   "kind": 1,
   "value": "*Printed output of the code cell above (evaluated from exactly the saved source in kernel K1 via Get; not a native notebook output).*\n\n| | |\n|---|---|\n| Λ, d1, d2, nilp | {{3, 2, 0}, 15, 225, 3} |\n| distinct total weights, distinct one-site weights | {36, 12} |\n| diag G | {1, 2, 4, 1, 4, 12, 8, 24, 64, 8, 48, 24, 128, 144, 256} |\n| pr, θ, θ12 | {200, {2/7, -3/5}, 31/35} |\n| JJ gl(3) relations | True |\n| G unique, positive, invariant for all Ee[i,j] | True |\n| nilpotency: Ee[i,j]^(nilp+1) = 0 (i != j), Ee[1,3]^nilp != 0 | True |",
