  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* Task 0 (cont). The Laurent coefficients of S2, S3 in u: the \"Gaudin T's\". S2 = c0 + Sum_s [a_s/(u-th_s) + b_s/(u-th_s)^2], S3 = c0 + Sum_s Sum_{k=1..3} c_{s,k}/(u-th_s)^k, fitted EXACTLY from rational u samples (sparse matrix coefficients) and verified at further sample points. laurent[g, ths] is memoized on its exact arguments (re-run this cell after any change to Sk). *)\nck = <||>;\nuSam = {3/7, -2/9, 5/11, 1/3, -4/5, 6/7, 7/3, 9/5, -3/2};\nbas2[ths_, u_] := {1, 1/(u - ths[[1]]), 1/(u - ths[[1]])^2, 1/(u - ths[[2]]), 1/(u - ths[[2]])^2};\nbas3[ths_, u_] := {1, 1/(u - ths[[1]]), 1/(u - ths[[1]])^2, 1/(u - ths[[1]])^3, 1/(u - ths[[2]]), 1/(u - ths[[2]])^2, 1/(u - ths[[2]])^3};\nfitLaurent[kk_, bas_, g_, ths_] := Module[{nb = Length[bas[ths, 1]], pts, Ainv, cs, resid},\n  pts = Take[uSam, nb]; Ainv = Inverse[Table[bas[ths, p], {p, pts}]];\n  cs = Table[Total[Table[Ainv[[j, k]] Sk[kk][g, ths, pts[[k]]], {k, nb}]], {j, nb}];\n  resid = Table[Total[Table[bas[ths, p][[j]] cs[[j]], {j, nb}]] - Sk[kk][g, ths, p], {p, Drop[uSam, nb]}];\n  {cs, resid}];\nlaurent[g_, ths_] := laurent[g, ths] = Module[{f2, f3, S3inf},\n  f2 = fitLaurent[2, bas2, g, ths]; f3 = fitLaurent[3, bas3, g, ths];\n  <|\"S2inf\" -> f2[[1, 1]], \"Hres\" -> {f2[[1, 2]], f2[[1, 4]]}, \"S2dbl\" -> {f2[[1, 3]], f2[[1, 5]]}, \"S3inf\" -> f3[[1, 1]], \"S3c\" -> <|{1, 1} -> f3[[1, 2]], {1, 2} -> f3[[1, 3]], {1, 3} -> f3[[1, 4]], {2, 1} -> f3[[1, 5]], {2, 2} -> f3[[1, 6]], {2, 3} -> f3[[1, 7]]|>,\n   \"resid2\" -> f2[[2]], \"resid3\" -> f3[[2]]|>];\nzeroQ[a_] := Union[Flatten[Normal[a]]] === {0};\nscalarQ[a_] := With[{A = Normal[a]}, zeroQ[A - A[[1, 1]] id2]];\n{tLaur, LA} = AbsoluteTiming[laurent[gZ, thN]];\nck[\"Laurent ansatz verified at extra points: S2 (4 pts), S3 (2 pts), exact\"] = {And @@ (zeroQ /@ LA[\"resid2\"]), And @@ (zeroQ /@ LA[\"resid3\"])};\nck[\"S3c[s,3] (s=1,2), S3inf, S2inf, S2dbl[s] are scalars\"] = {scalarQ[LA[\"S3c\"][{1, 3}]], scalarQ[LA[\"S3c\"][{2, 3}]], scalarQ[LA[\"S3inf\"]], scalarQ[LA[\"S2inf\"]], scalarQ[LA[\"S2dbl\"][[1]]], scalarQ[LA[\"S2dbl\"][[2]]]};\nWop = zP[[1]] (E1[1, 1] + E2[1, 1]) + zP[[2]] (E1[2, 2] + E2[2, 2]) + zP[[3]] (E1[3, 3] + E2[3, 3]);\nsumH = LA[\"Hres\"][[1]] + LA[\"Hres\"][[2]];\nck[\"Hres1 + Hres2 = +W + scalar ?  / = -W + scalar ?  (W = Sum_k zeta_k (E_tot)_kk)\"] = {scalarQ[sumH - Wop], scalarQ[sumH + Wop]};\nHform = Sum[zP[[i]] E1[i, i], {i, 3}] + Sum[E1[i, k] . E2[k, i], {i, 3}, {k, 3}]/th12;\n(* hand derivation from S2 = Sum_{i<j}(l_ii l_jj - l_ji l_ij) - l'_22 - 2 l'_33 (diagonal g): Res_{th1} S2 = -Sum_i g_i E1_ii - Sum_ij E1_ij E2_ji/th12 + (Sum g |Lambda| + |Lambda|^2/th12) id, i.e. MINUS the form expected in the plan (the dd - L convention); tested exactly *)\nHexact = -Hform + (Total[zP] lamTot + lamTot^2/th12) id2;\nck[\"H1 = Res_th1 S2 = -[Sum_i zeta_i E1_ii + Sum_ik E1_ik E2_ki/th12] + (Sum zeta |Lambda| + |Lambda|^2/th12) id (exact)\"] = zeroQ[LA[\"Hres\"][[1]] - Hexact];\nck[\"H1 + H2 + W = scalar = 2 |Lambda| Sum zeta exactly: {value, equal}\"] = With[{sc = Normal[sumH + Wop][[1, 1]]}, {sc, sc === 2 lamTot Total[zP]}];\nck[\"H2 = Res_th2 S2 = -Sum zeta_i E2_ii + Sum E1_ij E2_ji/th12 + (Sum zeta |Lambda| - |Lambda|^2/th12) id (exact)\"] = zeroQ[LA[\"Hres\"][[2]] - (-Sum[zP[[i]] E2[i, i], {i, 3}] + Sum[E1[i, k] . E2[k, i], {i, 3}, {k, 3}]/th12 + (Total[zP] lamTot - lamTot^2/th12) id2)];\nchecks = Join[checks, ck];\nGrid[Join[{{\"time (s): Laurent fit S2 + S3\", tLaur}}, List @@@ Normal[ck]], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
