  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## A2. Vacuum: the (inf,inf) vacuum ΩDinf, the companion-frame vacuum Ωc^G and κ^G, the vacuum Laurent data (closed forms in ω, θ)",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* Task 3 machinery. For a point (zeta, omega, thetas): the operator spaces D1 (independent subset of {id, W, H1, S3c12, S3c11, S3c22, S3c21}) and D2 = D1 + quadratic monomials (greedy independent subset, H1-products placed right after D1), the covectors Phi_X = reshape(<Om (x) Om|X, d1 x d1) (row = site 1, column = site 2), and the localisation systems: site 1 localises iff Phi_X.k = 0 for all k in NullSpace[{Om1}] (then <Om(x)Om|X = v (x) Om1 with v = Phi_X.e1), site 2 iff k.Phi_X = 0 (then = Om1 (x) u with u = e1.Phi_X). Everything exact. *)\nck = <||>;\nvecOf[a_] := Flatten[Normal[a]];\ngreedyIndep[ops_, names_] := Module[{keep = {}, mat = {}, rk = 0},\n  Do[With[{v = vecOf[ops[[i]]]}, If[MatrixRank[Append[mat, v]] > rk, AppendTo[mat, v]; AppendTo[keep, i]; rk++]], {i, Length[ops]}];\n  {ops[[keep]], names[[keep]]}];\nscanBuild[zz_, ww_, ths_] := Module[{g = DiagonalMatrix[zz], L, Wo, ops1, nm1, d1o, d1n, hprod, hn, prods, pn, d2o, d2n, nD1, nH, Om1, Om2v, K, Phis},\n  L = laurent[g, ths]; Wo = SparseArray[Sum[zz[[k]] (E1[k, k] + E2[k, k]), {k, 3}]];\n  ops1 = {id2, Wo, L[\"Hres\"][[1]], L[\"S3c\"][{1, 2}], L[\"S3c\"][{1, 1}], L[\"S3c\"][{2, 2}], L[\"S3c\"][{2, 1}]};\n  nm1 = {\"id\", \"W\", \"H1\", \"S3c[1,2]\", \"S3c[1,1]\", \"S3c[2,2]\", \"S3c[2,1]\"};\n  {d1o, d1n} = greedyIndep[ops1, nm1]; nD1 = Length[d1o];\n  hprod = Table[d1o[[3]] . d1o[[j]], {j, nD1}]; hn = Table[\"H1.\" <> d1n[[j]], {j, nD1}];\n  prods = Flatten[Table[d1o[[i]] . d1o[[j]], {i, nD1}, {j, i, nD1}], 1]; pn = Flatten[Table[d1n[[i]] <> \".\" <> d1n[[j]], {i, nD1}, {j, i, nD1}], 1];\n  {d2o, d2n} = greedyIndep[Join[d1o, hprod, prods], Join[d1n, hn, pn]];\n  nH = Length[Select[d2n[[nD1 + 1 ;;]], StringStartsQ[#, \"H1.\"] &]];\n  Om1 = ΩD[zz, ww[[1 ;; 2]]]; Om2v = kron[Om1, Om1];\n  K = NullSpace[{Om1}];\n  Phis = Table[Partition[Om2v . op, d1], {op, d2o}];\n  <|\"zz\" -> zz, \"ww\" -> ww, \"ths\" -> ths, \"D1\" -> d1o, \"D1n\" -> d1n, \"D2\" -> d2o, \"D2n\" -> d2n, \"nD1\" -> nD1, \"nH\" -> nH, \"Om1\" -> Om1, \"K\" -> K, \"Phis\" -> Phis, \"rkCubic\" -> Missing[]|>];\n(* the localisation matrix: rows indexed by (i, m), columns by operators; site 1: (Phi_a.k_m)_i; site 2: (k_m.Phi_a)_j *)\nlocMat[sc_, site_] := If[site == 1, Table[Flatten[Table[(sc[\"Phis\"][[a]] . k), {k, sc[\"K\"]}]], {a, Length[sc[\"Phis\"]]}], Table[Flatten[Table[(k . sc[\"Phis\"][[a]]), {k, sc[\"K\"]}]], {a, Length[sc[\"Phis\"]]}]] // Transpose;\n(* covector v(c) for the coefficient vector c: site 1: Phi.e1 (first column), site 2: e1.Phi (first row); Om1[[1]] = 1 *)\nvMap[sc_, site_] := If[site == 1, Table[sc[\"Phis\"][[a, All, 1]], {a, Length[sc[\"Phis\"]]}], Table[sc[\"Phis\"][[a, 1, All]], {a, Length[sc[\"Phis\"]]}]];\nlocSpace[sc_, site_, cols_] := Module[{M = locMat[sc, site][[All, cols]], ns, V = vMap[sc, site][[cols]], vs},\n  ns = NullSpace[M]; vs = If[ns === {}, {}, ns . V]; {ns, vs, If[vs === {}, 0, MatrixRank[vs]]}];\n(* one-site machinery (copied from the round-1 localiser cell): one-site cdet Sk1 with L_ij = g_ij + E_ij/(u - theta), Laurent fits, covector weight ranks *)\nLm1[g_, th_, u_] := Association[Flatten[Table[{l[i, j] -> g[[i, j]] id1 + Ee[i, j]/(u - th), lp[i, j] -> -Ee[i, j]/(u - th)^2, lpp[i, j] -> 2 Ee[i, j]/(u - th)^3}, {i, 3}, {j, 3}], 1]];\nSk1[k_][g_, th_, u_] := Module[{M = Lm1[g, th, u]}, Total[Table[t[[1]] If[t[[2]] === {}, id1, Dot @@ Map[M[#] &, t[[2]]]], {t, Ssym[k]}]]];\nbas1[n_][th_, u_] := Table[1/(u - th)^j, {j, 0, n}];\nfit1[kk_, n_, g_, th_] := Module[{pts = Take[uSam, n + 1], Ainv, cs, resid}, Ainv = Inverse[Table[bas1[n][th, p], {p, pts}]]; cs = Table[Total[Table[Ainv[[j, k]] Sk1[kk][g, th, pts[[k]]], {k, n + 1}]], {j, n + 1}]; resid = Table[Total[Table[bas1[n][th, p][[j]] cs[[j]], {j, n + 1}]] - Sk1[kk][g, th, p], {p, Drop[uSam, n + 1]}]; {cs, resid}];\noneSiteOps[zz_, ww_, th_] := Module[{g = DiagonalMatrix[zz], f2, f3, gp = gpVar[1][zz, ww]}, f2 = fit1[2, 2, g, th]; f3 = fit1[3, 3, g, th];\n  <|\"names\" -> {\"id\", \"C_zeta\", \"S2res\", \"S3c[2]\", \"S3c[1]\", \"(g-g').E\"}, \"ops\" -> {id1, SparseArray[Sum[zz[[k]] Ee[k, k], {k, 3}]], f2[[1, 2]], f3[[1, 3]], f3[[1, 2]], SparseArray[Sum[(g - gp)[[i, j]] Ee[j, i], {i, 3}, {j, 3}]]}, \"resid\" -> Join[f2[[2]], f3[[2]]]|>];\n(* weights of the one-site space covered by a set of covectors *)\nwtRank[vs_] := Table[{u12wts[[m]], u12dims[[m]], MatrixRank[vs[[All, u12idx[[m]]]]]}, {m, Length[u12wts]}];\nGrid[{{\"machinery defined\", \"scanBuild, locMat, vMap, locSpace, Lm1, Sk1, fit1, oneSiteOps, wtRank\"}}, Frame -> All]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
