  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "*Printed output of the code cell above (evaluated from exactly the saved source in kernel K1 via Get; not a native notebook output).*\n\n| | |\n|---|---|\n| machinery defined | scanBuild, locMat, vMap, locSpace, Lm1, Sk1, fit1, oneSiteOps, wtRank |",
   "languageId": "markdown",
