   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* Task C3. Omega (x) Omega = Omega_D[zeta, om] (x) Omega_D[zeta, om] is the left eigencovector of S_k^{(g')} with g' = M^-1 diag(om) M, and cdet(dd - L_{g'}) = rho(M)^-1 cdet(dd - L_{diag om}) rho(M) (the adjoint action on E_ij), so the eigenvalues are those of S_k^{(diag om)} on the highest-weight (row) vector e1 (x) e1: lambda_k(u) = (e1 (x) e1 . S_k^{diag(om)}(u))[[1]], independent of zeta. Computed SYMBOLICALLY in (om1, om2, om3, theta1, theta2) by pushing the row vector e1 (x) e1 through the ordered words of the symbolic cdet (Ssym), with x_s = u - theta_s. Laurent data by residues: H_s = Res_{theta_s} S2, double pole, a_s (double pole) and b_s (simple pole) of S3, and the u -> infinity values e2(om), e3(om). Checked against the exact two-site eigencovector at P, P', and a second omega. *)\nck = <||>;\nwvS = {wa1, wa2, wa3};\nr0 = kron[e1, e1];\nrowFac[r_, l[i_, j_]] := If[i == j, wvS[[i]] r, 0 r] + (r . E1[i, j])/xa + (r . E2[i, j])/xb;\nrowFac[r_, lp[i_, j_]] := -(r . E1[i, j])/xa^2 - (r . E2[i, j])/xb^2;\nrowFac[r_, lpp[i_, j_]] := 2 (r . E1[i, j])/xa^3 + 2 (r . E2[i, j])/xb^3;\nevalRow[word_] := Fold[rowFac, r0, word];\nvacVec[k_] := Total[Table[t[[1]] evalRow[t[[2]]], {t, Ssym[k]}]];\n{tVac, vv2} = AbsoluteTiming[Expand[vacVec[2]]];\nvv3 = Expand[vacVec[3]];\nck[\"e1 (x) e1 is a left eigenvector of S2^{diag om}(u), S3^{diag om}(u): all components except the first vanish (exact, symbolic)\"] = {Union[Rest[vv2]] === {0}, Union[Rest[vv3]] === {0}};\nlam2 = vv2[[1]]; lam3 = vv3[[1]];\ntoU[ex_] := ex /. {xa -> u - ta, xb -> u - tb};\nlc[ex_, t_, k_] := Residue[(u - t)^(k - 1) toU[ex], {u, t}];\ninf2 = Limit[toU[lam2], u -> Infinity]; inf3 = Limit[toU[lam3], u -> Infinity];\nvacData = <|\"S2inf\" -> inf2, \"S3inf\" -> inf3,\n  \"H1\" -> lc[lam2, ta, 1], \"H2\" -> lc[lam2, tb, 1], \"S2dbl1\" -> lc[lam2, ta, 2], \"S2dbl2\" -> lc[lam2, tb, 2],\n  \"b1\" -> lc[lam3, ta, 1], \"b2\" -> lc[lam3, tb, 1], \"a1\" -> lc[lam3, ta, 2], \"a2\" -> lc[lam3, tb, 2], \"triple1\" -> lc[lam3, ta, 3], \"triple2\" -> lc[lam3, tb, 3]|>;\nthd = th12s; \nvacClosed = Association[KeyValueMap[#1 -> Collect[Together[#2 /. ta -> tb + thd], thd] &, vacData]];\n(* the closed forms *)\nck[\"closed forms (symbolic): e2 and e3 of om at u -> infinity\"] = {Expand[inf2 - (wa1 wa2 + wa1 wa3 + wa2 wa3)], Expand[inf3 - wa1 wa2 wa3]};\n(* numeric verification at P, P', second omega with the exact two-site eigencovector *)\nvacNum[ww_] := Association[KeyValueMap[#1 -> (#2 /. Thread[{wa1, wa2, wa3} -> ww] /. {th12s -> thN[[1]] - thN[[2]]}) &, vacClosed]];\nexactVac[zz_, ww_] := Module[{g = gpVar[1][zz, ww], O2 = Om2[zz, ww], L, ev},\n  L = laurent[g, thN]; ev[A_] := With[{c = O2 . A}, {Union[Flatten[c - (c[[1]]/O2[[1]]) O2]] === {0}, c[[1]]/O2[[1]]}];\n  <|\"H1\" -> ev[L[\"Hres\"][[1]]], \"H2\" -> ev[L[\"Hres\"][[2]]], \"b1\" -> ev[L[\"S3c\"][{1, 1}]], \"b2\" -> ev[L[\"S3c\"][{2, 1}]], \"a1\" -> ev[L[\"S3c\"][{1, 2}]], \"a2\" -> ev[L[\"S3c\"][{2, 2}]], \"S2dbl1\" -> ev[L[\"S2dbl\"][[1]]], \"S2dbl2\" -> ev[L[\"S2dbl\"][[2]]], \"S2inf\" -> ev[L[\"S2inf\"]], \"S3inf\" -> ev[L[\"S3inf\"]], \"triple1\" -> ev[L[\"S3c\"][{1, 3}]], \"triple2\" -> ev[L[\"S3c\"][{2, 3}]]|>];\nvPts = {{zP, wP}, {zP, wpP}, {zQ, wQ}, {zQ, wP}};\nvCmp = Table[With[{ex = exactVac[p[[1]], p[[2]]], cf = vacNum[p[[2]]]}, {p[[2]], And @@ (#[[1]] & /@ Values[ex]), And @@ Table[ex[k][[2]] === cf[k], {k, Keys[ex]}]}], {p, vPts}];\nck[\"exact two-site eigenvalues equal the closed forms (and the covector is an eigencovector): {om, all eigen, all equal}, at (P, wP), (P, wpP), (P', wQ), (P', wP)\"] = vCmp;\nck[\"round-1 numbers at P, om = wP: H1 = 12539/930, H2 = 4139/930, a_s = 9/5, b1 = 2173/310, b2 = 493/310, e2 = 131/15, e3 = 7/2 (closed forms evaluated); only for [2,1,0]\"] = If[Λ === {2, 1, 0}, With[{cf = vacNum[wP]}, {cf[\"H1\"], cf[\"H2\"], cf[\"a1\"], cf[\"a2\"], cf[\"b1\"], cf[\"b2\"], cf[\"S2inf\"], cf[\"S3inf\"]}], \"n/a\"];\nchecks = Join[checks, ck];\nGrid[Join[{{\"time (s)\", tVac}}, Table[{\"vac \" <> k, ToString[vacClosed[k], InputForm]}, {k, Keys[vacClosed]}], List @@@ Normal[ck]], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
