  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ck = <||>;\n(* exact HW kets of V(x)V (common null space of the total raising ops per total-weight sector), their sectors (computed, not typed in), G-orthogonal projectors per HW sector. G2 = G(x)G is the invariant inner product (JJ is not Hermitian), so P_HW = H (H^T G2 H)^-1 H^T G2 is the projector orthogonal in the Hermitian EH frame. u12wts/u12idx = one-site weights and the GT indices per weight; the CG slice of an HW state of weight mu sits at the one-site weight nu = mu - Lambda (site 2 = e1). *)\nu12raiseM = Join[E1[1, 2] + E2[1, 2], E1[1, 3] + E2[1, 3], E1[2, 3] + E2[2, 3]];\nhwKets[mu_] := hwKets[mu] = With[{sec = secOf[mu]}, Table[Normal[SparseArray[Thread[sec -> v], {d2}]], {v, NullSpace[Normal[u12raiseM[[All, sec]]]]}]];\nhwSecs = Reverse[Sort[Select[Union[wtBasis], Length[hwKets[#]] > 0 &]]];\nu12HW = Flatten[hwKets /@ hwSecs, 1];\ngd2 = Flatten[KroneckerProduct[Diagonal[gMet], Diagonal[gMet]]];\nhwH[mu_] := hwH[mu] = Transpose[hwKets[mu]];\nhwMinv[mu_] := hwMinv[mu] = Inverse[Transpose[hwH[mu]] . (gd2 hwH[mu])];\nPHWc[mu_][psi_] := hwH[mu] . (hwMinv[mu] . (Transpose[hwH[mu]] . (gd2 psi)));\ngNorm[psi_] := Sqrt[Total[gd2 psi^2]];\nu12wt1 = wtL1; u12wts = Union[u12wt1]; u12idx = Table[Flatten[Position[u12wt1, m]], {m, u12wts}]; u12dims = Length /@ u12idx;\nidxOf[wt_] := u12idx[[Position[u12wts, wt][[1, 1]]]];\nhwList = Flatten[Table[Table[{mu, c}, {c, Length[hwKets[mu]]}], {mu, hwSecs}], 1];\nck[\"HW: number of kets, number of sectors\"] = {Length[u12HW], Length[hwSecs]};\nck[\"HW kets annihilated by all total raising ops\"] = And @@ (Normal[u12raiseM . #] === ConstantArray[0, 3 d2] & /@ u12HW);\nck[\"HW sectors, multiplicities, sector sizes\"] = {hwSecs, Length[hwKets[#]] & /@ hwSecs, Length[secOf[#]] & /@ hwSecs};\nck[\"G2-projector: idempotent, fixes HW kets, G2-orthogonal residual (exact)\"] = With[{vv = Table[(-1)^k k/7, {k, d2}]}, And @@ Table[PHWc[mu][PHWc[mu][vv]] === PHWc[mu][vv] && (And @@ (PHWc[mu][#] === # & /@ hwKets[mu])) && (And @@ (Total[gd2 # (vv - PHWc[mu][vv])] === 0 & /@ hwKets[mu])), {mu, hwSecs}]];\nck[\"slice weights nu = mu - Lambda, their dims (the site-1 weight space the CG slice lives on)\"] = Table[{mu - Λ, Length[idxOf[mu - Λ]]}, {mu, hwSecs}];\nchecks = Join[checks, ck];\nGrid[Join[{{\"# HW kets, # HW sectors\", ToString[ck[\"HW: number of kets, number of sectors\"], InputForm]}, {\"annihilated by raising ops\", ck[\"HW kets annihilated by all total raising ops\"]}, {\"sectors; multiplicities; sector sizes\", ToString[ck[\"HW sectors, multiplicities, sector sizes\"], InputForm]}, {\"G2-projector exact\", ck[\"G2-projector: idempotent, fixes HW kets, G2-orthogonal residual (exact)\"]}, {\"slice weights nu = mu - Lambda and dims\", ToString[ck[\"slice weights nu = mu - Lambda, their dims (the site-1 weight space the CG slice lives on)\"], InputForm]}, {\"one-site weights, dims\", ToString[{u12wts, u12dims}, InputForm]}}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
