   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "*Printed output of the code cell above (evaluated from exactly the saved source in kernel K1 via Get; not a native notebook output).*\n\n| | |\n|---|---|\n| # HW kets, # HW sectors | {10, 8} |\n| annihilated by raising ops | True |\n| sectors; multiplicities; sector sizes | {{{6, 4, 0}, {6, 3, 1}, {6, 2, 2}, {5, 5, 0}, {5, 4, 1}, {5, 3, 2}, {4, 4, 2}, {4, 3, 3}}, {1, 1, 1, 1, 2, 2, 1, 1}, {1, 2, 3, 2, 6, 10, 14, 18}} |\n| G2-projector exact | True |\n| slice weights nu = mu - Lambda and dims | {{{3, 2, 0}, 1}, {{3, 1, 1}, 1}, {{3, 0, 2}, 1}, {{2, 3, 0}, 1}, {{2, 2, 1}, 2}, {{2, 1, 2}, 2}, {{1, 2, 2}, 2}, {{1, 1, 3}, 1}} |\n| one-site weights, dims | {{{0, 2, 3}, {0, 3, 2}, {1, 1, 3}, {1, 2, 2}, {1, 3, 1}, {2, 0, 3}, {2, 1, 2}, {2, 2, 1}, {2, 3, 0}, {3, 0, 2}, {3, 1, 1}, {3, 2, 0}}, {1, 1, 1, 2, 1, 1, 2, 2, 1, 1, 1, 1}} |",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
