  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* Task 2. Eigenstates of the commuting family with the KET twist g = diag(zeta): per total-weight sector mu, Eigensystem (200 digits) of N[S2(u0) + Pi S3(u1)] restricted to the sector (the exact rational S's are built first, only the sector block is converted). Each state: G-norm 1 (gNorm, G2 = G(x)G the invariant inner product), sign = first component with |c| > 1e-60 max positive, eigenvalues ev2 = S2(u0), ev3 = S3(u1) from the largest component, eigenvector residuals of both, raising residual rr = ||(E12_tot, E23_tot) Psi||, hwFrac = ||P_HW Psi||/||Psi|| (G-norm) in the HW sectors. HW-limit branches = the dim(HW_mu) states of sector mu with the smallest rr; copies ordered by Re of the mix eigenvalue. *)\nck = <||>;\nraiseSec[mu_] := raiseSec[mu] = With[{sec = secOf[mu]}, Normal[Join[(E1[1, 2] + E2[1, 2])[[All, sec]], (E1[2, 3] + E2[2, 3])[[All, sec]]]]];\nsecBlocks[zz_, mu_] := secBlocks[zz, mu] = With[{sec = secOf[mu], gz = DiagonalMatrix[zz]}, {N[Normal[Sk[2][gz, thN, u0][[sec, sec]]], pr], N[Normal[Sk[3][gz, thN, u1][[sec, sec]]], pr]}];\nsignNorm[v_] := Module[{mx = Max[Abs[v]], first}, first = First[Select[v, Abs[#] > 10^-60 mx &]]; v Sign[Re[first]]];\nstatesG[zz_, mu_] := statesG[zz, mu] = Module[{sec = secOf[mu], A2, A3, mix, es, isHW = MemberQ[hwSecs, mu], out = {}},\n  {A2, A3} = secBlocks[zz, mu]; mix = A2 + N[Pi, pr] A3; es = Eigensystem[mix];\n  Do[Module[{v, psi, km, e2, e3, rr},\n    v = signNorm[es[[2, k]]]; psi = Normal[SparseArray[Thread[sec -> v], {d2}]]; psi = psi/gNorm[psi]; v = psi[[sec]];\n    km = First@Ordering[Abs[v], -1]; e2 = (A2 . v)[[km]]/v[[km]]; e3 = (A3 . v)[[km]]/v[[km]];\n    rr = Norm[raiseSec[mu] . v]/Norm[v];\n    AppendTo[out, <|\"mu\" -> mu, \"k\" -> k, \"psi\" -> psi, \"ev\" -> es[[1, k]], \"ev2\" -> e2, \"ev3\" -> e3, \"res\" -> Max[Norm[A2 . v - e2 v], Norm[A3 . v - e3 v]]/Norm[v], \"rr\" -> rr, \"hwFrac\" -> If[isHW, gNorm[PHWc[mu][psi]]/gNorm[psi], Indeterminate]|>]], {k, Length[sec]}];\n  out];\nallSecs = Union[wtBasis];\nbranchesG[zz_] := branchesG[zz] = Module[{out = {}},\n  Do[Module[{ss = statesG[zz, mu], nHW = If[MemberQ[hwSecs, mu], Length[hwKets[mu]], 0], pick},\n    pick = SortBy[Ordering[ss[[All, \"rr\"]], nHW], Re[ss[[#, \"ev\"]]] &];\n    Do[AppendTo[out, Append[ss[[k]], <|\"branch\" -> MemberQ[pick, k], \"copy\" -> If[MemberQ[pick, k], Position[pick, k][[1, 1]], 0]|>]], {k, Length[ss]}]], {mu, allSecs}];\n  <|\"states\" -> out, \"zz\" -> zz|>];\nbrOf[B_, mu_, copy_] := First@Select[B[\"states\"], #[\"mu\"] === mu && #[\"copy\"] === copy &];\n(* at the finite-twist point P (and P'): all d2 states *)\n{tP, BP} = AbsoluteTiming[branchesG[zP]];\n{tQ, BQ} = AbsoluteTiming[branchesG[zQ]];\nstP = BP[\"states\"];\nck[\"P: # states (= d2), max eigenvector residual (S2, S3), min Precision of psi, max |G-norm - 1|\"] = {Length[stP], sz[Max[stP[[All, \"res\"]]]], Min[Precision /@ stP[[All, \"psi\"]]], sz[Max[Abs[gNorm[#[\"psi\"]] - 1] & /@ stP]]};\nck[\"P: all eigenvalues real (max |Im ev2|, |Im ev3|, relative) and pairwise distinct (S2(u0), S3(u1)) pairs: min distance\"] = {sz[Max[Abs[Im[stP[[All, \"ev2\"]]]], Abs[Im[stP[[All, \"ev3\"]]]]]], N[Min[Flatten[Table[Abs[stP[[i, \"ev2\"]] - stP[[j, \"ev2\"]]] + Abs[stP[[i, \"ev3\"]] - stP[[j, \"ev3\"]]], {i, Length[stP]}, {j, i + 1, Length[stP]}]]], 4]};\nx0Gn = N[x0Of[zP], pr];\nx0ovP = Table[x0Gn . s[\"psi\"], {s, stP}];\nck[\"P: x0G . Psi_B nonzero for all d2 states: min |x0G.Psi| (G-normalised states), # exactly-zero-to-precision\"] = {N[Min[Abs[x0ovP]], 5], Count[Abs[x0ovP], x_ /; x < 10^-100]};\nck[\"P': # states, max residual, all (S2,S3) pairs distinct (min distance)\"] = {Length[BQ[\"states\"]], sz[Max[BQ[\"states\"][[All, \"res\"]]]], N[Min[Flatten[Table[Abs[BQ[\"states\"][[i, \"ev2\"]] - BQ[\"states\"][[j, \"ev2\"]]] + Abs[BQ[\"states\"][[i, \"ev3\"]] - BQ[\"states\"][[j, \"ev3\"]]], {i, d2}, {j, i + 1, d2}]]], 4]};\n(* reference-vacuum overlap <ΩD[zeta,omega0] (x) ΩD[zeta,omega0]|Psi> for the HW-limit branches at the regime point (omega0 = eps (2/5, 1/7)): recorded in the Task 4 cell *)\nchecks = Join[checks, ck];\nGrid[Join[{{\"time (s): all d2 states at P, at P'\", N[{tP, tQ}, 3]}}, List @@@ Normal[ck]], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
