   "kind": 1,
   "value": "*Printed output of the code cell above (evaluated from exactly the saved source in kernel K1 via Get; not a native notebook output).*\n\n| | |\n|---|---|\n| time (s): all d2 states at P, at P' | {0.8046696, 0.8014158} |\n| P: # states (= d2), max eigenvector residual (S2, S3), min Precision of psi, max \\|G-norm - 1\\| | {225, 4.566477532200911*^-195, 197.755590956978, 1.7555331835277713*^-198} |\n| P: all eigenvalues real (max \\|Im ev2\\|, \\|Im ev3\\|, relative) and pairwise distinct (S2(u0), S3(u1)) pairs: min distance | {0, 0.3421839842080294466`4.} |\n| P: x0G . Psi_B nonzero for all d2 states: min \\|x0G.Psi\\| (G-normalised states), # exactly-zero-to-precision | {4.9362208453414133146119179625429`5.*^-7, 0} |\n| P': # states, max residual, all (S2,S3) pairs distinct (min distance) | {225, 2.992439213614741*^-194, 0.6225711531560572267`4.} |",
