  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* Task 2 (cont). HW-limit branches at the regime point zeta = eps phi (eps = 1, 2, 4 10^-6, phi = (1/3,-2/7,5/11)), the exact HW states of the UNTWISTED model (the eps -> 0 limits): hwTrue[{mu, copy}] = the exact normalised HW kets for multiplicity 1; for multiplicity m >= 2 the eigenvectors, inside the exact HW space, of the matrix of S2(u0) + Pi S3(u1) at g = 0 (the Gaudin untwisted copies; the 2x2 matrices of S2(u0), S3(u1) and of the Laurent coefficient S3c[1,2] are printed), copies ordered by Re of the eigenvalue and G-normalised with the same sign convention. *)\nck = <||>;\ngZ0 = ConstantArray[0, {3, 3}];\nA20 = Sk[2][gZ0, thN, u0]; A30 = Sk[3][gZ0, thN, u1]; S3c12g0 = laurent[gZ0, thN][\"S3c\"][{1, 2}];\nhwMat[A_, mu_] := With[{H = hwH[mu]}, hwMinv[mu] . (Transpose[H] . (gd2 (A . H)))];\nck[\"untwisted HW space invariant: A.H = H.M exactly for S2(u0), S3(u1), S3c[1,2] at g = 0, every HW sector\"] = And @@ Table[And @@ Table[Union[Flatten[Normal[A . hwH[mu] - hwH[mu] . hwMat[A, mu]]]] === {0}, {A, {A20, A30, S3c12g0}}], {mu, hwSecs}];\nmultSecs = Select[hwSecs, Length[hwKets[#]] >= 2 &];\nhwTrue = Association[Flatten[Table[\n   If[Length[hwKets[mu]] == 1, {{mu, 1} -> With[{v = N[hwKets[mu][[1]], pr]}, signNorm[v/gNorm[v]]]},\n    Module[{Mm = N[hwMat[A20, mu] + Pi hwMat[A30, mu], pr], es, vs},\n     es = Eigensystem[Mm]; vs = Table[With[{v = hwH[mu] . es[[2, k]]}, signNorm[v/gNorm[v]]], {k, Length[es[[1]]]}];\n     ord = Ordering[Re[es[[1]]]];\n     Table[{mu, c} -> vs[[ord[[c]]]], {c, Length[ord]}]]], {mu, hwSecs}], 1]];\nck[\"hwTrue: G-norm 1, in the HW space (raising residual), Precision min\"] = {N[Max[Abs[gNorm /@ Values[hwTrue] - 1]], 3], sz[Max[Table[Norm[Normal[u12raiseM] . v], {v, Values[hwTrue]}]]], Min[Precision /@ Values[hwTrue]]};\n(* printable exact 2x2 data of the multiplicity-2 sectors *)\nmultData = Table[<|\"mu\" -> mu, \"S2u0\" -> hwMat[A20, mu], \"S3u1\" -> hwMat[A30, mu], \"S3c12\" -> hwMat[S3c12g0, mu], \"mixEV\" -> N[Eigenvalues[N[hwMat[A20, mu] + Pi hwMat[A30, mu], 40]], 20], \"S3c12EV\" -> N[Eigenvalues[hwMat[S3c12g0, mu]], 20], \"commute\" -> (hwMat[A20, mu] . hwMat[A30, mu] === hwMat[A30, mu] . hwMat[A20, mu])|>, {mu, multSecs}];\n(* the untwisted copies in the exact HW basis hwKets[mu] (coefficients c with copy = H.c, G-normalised), and the eigenvectors of the matrix of S3c[1,2] (g = 0) on the HW space: are they parallel to the copies? *)\nmultVec = Table[Module[{H = hwH[mu], es3 = Eigensystem[hwMat[S3c12g0, mu]], cop, cs, v3},\n   cop = Table[hwTrue[{mu, c}], {c, Length[hwKets[mu]]}];\n   cs = Table[hwMinv[mu] . (Transpose[H] . (gd2 t)), {t, cop}];\n   v3 = Table[With[{v = H . N[es3[[2, k]], pr]}, v/gNorm[v]], {k, 2}];\n   <|\"mu\" -> mu, \"copyCoeffs\" -> N[cs, 15], \"S3c12evecCoeffs\" -> N[Table[hwMinv[mu] . (Transpose[H] . (gd2 v)), {v, v3}], 15], \"S3c12ev\" -> N[es3[[1]], 15], \"dev\" -> Table[sz[Min[Norm[v - t], Norm[v + t]]], {v, v3}, {t, cop}]|>], {mu, multSecs}];\n(* branches at the regime point for the three eps *)\nregZ[ie_] := epsL[[ie]] phiP;\n{tB1, B1} = AbsoluteTiming[branchesG[regZ[1]]]; B2 = branchesG[regZ[2]]; B3 = branchesG[regZ[3]];\nhwListG = Flatten[Table[Table[{mu, c}, {c, Length[hwKets[mu]]}], {mu, hwSecs}], 1];\nnb = Length[hwListG];\ndevTrue[B_, lab_] := With[{b = brOf[B, lab[[1]], lab[[2]]][\"psi\"], t = hwTrue[lab]}, Min[Norm[b - t], Norm[b + t]]];\nck[\"# states, # branches per eps\"] = Table[{Length[B[\"states\"]], Count[B[\"states\"], s_ /; s[\"branch\"]]}, {B, {B1, B2, B3}}];\nck[\"top branch = e1 (x) e1 (max abs dev)\"] = With[{p = brOf[B1, hwSecs[[1]], 1][\"psi\"]}, sz[Max[Abs[p - kron[e1, e1]]]]];\nck[\"rr separation per sector at eps = 1e-6: {mu, max branch rr, min other rr}\"] = Table[With[{s = Select[B1[\"states\"], #[\"mu\"] === mu &]}, {mu, N[Max[Select[s, #[\"branch\"] &][[All, \"rr\"]]], 3], If[Length[Select[s, ! #[\"branch\"] &]] == 0, \"-\", N[Min[Select[s, ! #[\"branch\"] &][[All, \"rr\"]]], 3]]}], {mu, hwSecs}];\nbrTab = Table[{lab[[1]], lab[[2]], sz[brOf[B1, lab[[1]], lab[[2]]][\"rr\"]], sz[1 - brOf[B1, lab[[1]], lab[[2]]][\"hwFrac\"]], sz[devTrue[B1, lab]], sz[devTrue[B2, lab]], sz[devTrue[B3, lab]], If[devTrue[B1, lab] < 10^-100, \"-\", N[Log[devTrue[B3, lab]/devTrue[B1, lab]]/Log[4], 4]]}, {lab, hwListG}];\nck[\"precision of psi (min over branch states at the 3 eps)\"] = Min[Precision /@ Join[B1[\"states\"][[All, \"psi\"]], B2[\"states\"][[All, \"psi\"]], B3[\"states\"][[All, \"psi\"]]]];\nchecks = Join[checks, ck];\nGrid[Join[{{\"time (s) all states at eps=1e-6\", N[tB1, 3], \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\"}}, List @@@ Normal[ck] /. {a_, b_} :> {a, b, \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\"}, {{\"mu\", \"copy\", \"raising resid rr (eps=1e-6)\", \"1 - hwFrac\", \"||branch - exact|| eps=1e-6\", \"2e-6\", \"4e-6\", \"exponent (4e-6/1e-6)\"}}, brTab, Join[{{\"multiplicity-2 sectors (untwisted HW space, exact 2x2):\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\"}}, Flatten[Table[{{\"mu\", ToString[md[\"mu\"]], \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\"}, {\"S2(u0) on HW space\", ToString[md[\"S2u0\"], InputForm], \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\"}, {\"S3(u1)\", ToString[md[\"S3u1\"], InputForm], \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\"}, {\"S3c[1,2] (g=0)\", ToString[md[\"S3c12\"], InputForm], \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\"}, {\"eigenvalues of S2(u0)+Pi S3(u1); of S3c[1,2]\", ToString[{md[\"mixEV\"], md[\"S3c12EV\"]}, InputForm], \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\"}, {\"S2(u0), S3(u1) commute on HW space\", ToString[md[\"commute\"]], \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\"}}, {md, multData}], 1], Flatten[Table[{{\"mu\", ToString[mv[\"mu\"]], \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\"}, {\"untwisted copies c=1,2 as coefficients on the exact HW kets hwKets[mu] (G-norm 1)\", ToString[mv[\"copyCoeffs\"], InputForm], \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\"}, {\"eigenvalues, eigenvectors (HW-ket coefficients) of the 2x2 matrix of S3c[1,2] at g = 0\", ToString[{mv[\"S3c12ev\"], mv[\"S3c12evecCoeffs\"]}, InputForm], \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\"}, {\"||eigvec_k - copy_c|| (k, c = 1,2; up to sign)\", ToString[mv[\"dev\"], InputForm], \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\"}}, {mv, multVec}], 1]]], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "*Printed output of the code cell above (evaluated from exactly the saved source in kernel K1 via Get; not a native notebook output).*\n\n| | | | | | | | |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| time (s) all states at eps=1e-6 | 0.7237333 |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| untwisted HW space invariant: A.H = H.M exactly for S2(u0), S3(u1), S3c[1,2] at g = 0, every HW sector | True |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| hwTrue: G-norm 1, in the HW space (raising residual), Precision min | {0``199.66812787992848, 6.293683172765699*^-200, 199.02876740261684} |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| # states, # branches per eps | {{225, 10}, {225, 10}, {225, 10}} |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| top branch = e1 (x) e1 (max abs dev) | 2.0000001455592258*^-200 |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| rr separation per sector at eps = 1e-6: {mu, max branch rr, min other rr} | {{{6, 4, 0}, 0, \"-\"}, {{6, 3, 1}, 2.3181033067840758565835317349552`3.*^-7, 2.8284271247461805983`3.}, {{6, 2, 2}, 5.353430272724`3.*^-7, 1.999999999999946264`3.}, {{5, 5, 0}, 1.9385308354977593253887818522841`3.*^-7, 1.4142135623730817626`3.}, {{5, 4, 1}, 2.371896778779959864824622428614`3.*^-7, 2.1019861865656327604`3.}, {{5, 3, 2}, 4.0757937296`3.*^-7, 2.077333000486059275`3.}, {{4, 4, 2}, 3.556883745419`3.*^-7, 1.6798259200338654905`3.}, {{4, 3, 3}, 7.199373612879`3.*^-7, 1.5195992324990903005`3.}} |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| precision of psi (min over branch states at the 3 eps) | 197.15211046578327 |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| mu | copy | raising resid rr (eps=1e-6) | 1 - hwFrac | \\|\\|branch - exact\\|\\| eps=1e-6 | 2e-6 | 4e-6 | exponent (4e-6/1e-6) |\n| {6, 4, 0} | 1 | 0 | 4.000000291118452*^-200 | 4.000000145559486*^-200 | 4.000000291118714*^-200 | 4.0000005822369243*^-200 | - |\n| {6, 3, 1} | 1 | 2.3181033067840758565835317349552`3.*^-7 | 3.35850183807704770677787`3.*^-15 | 5.795258266960194507305214766645`3.*^-8 | 1.1590516533920067868748991219986`3.*^-7 | 2.3181033067837566570606476567446`3.*^-7 | 0.9999999999999000658`4. |\n| {6, 2, 2} | 1 | 5.353430272724`