 |  |  |  |  |\n| S3(u1) | {{-50341095/295936, -21356055/147968}, {-7118685/295936, 6863535/147968}} |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| S3c[1,2] (g=0) | {{455/31, -210/31}, {-35/31, 770/31}} |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| eigenvalues of S2(u0)+Pi S3(u1); of S3c[1,2] | {{721.70719200954701111488445235581007933849`20., -52.65920484993573128236131666113470190265`20.}, {25.54263349691267650665703796481027128516`20., 13.97349553534538800947199429325424484397`20.}} |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| S2(u0), S3(u1) commute on HW space | True |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| mu | {5, 3, 2} |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| S2(u0) on HW space | {{44492/81, 0}, {0, 44492/81}} |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| S3(u1) | {{-1199205/4624, -2372895/73984}, {-2372895/36992, 2270835/36992}} |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| S3c[1,2] (g=0) | {{2240/93, -140/93}, {-280/93, 3640/93}} |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| eigenvalues of S2(u0)+Pi S3(u1); of S3c[1,2] | {{761.90193004365158988642972084076454127621`20., -285.23255799568094956180011113669134478628`20.}, {39.43506816321428455141427380034910101199`20., 23.79073828839861867439217781255412479445`20.}} |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| S2(u0), S3(u1) commute on HW space | True |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| mu | {5, 4, 1} |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| untwisted copies c=1,2 as coefficients on the exact HW kets hwKets[mu] (G-norm 1) | {{0.10187297492719881226769040796006945694`15., 0.01058588200967112669152877749326910128`15.}, {-0.03505766444909271609655203774013107655`15., 0.05622942846843496947960959272666927911`15.}} |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| eigenvalues, eigenvectors (HW-ket coefficients) of the 2x2 matrix of S3c[1,2] at g = 0 | {{25.54263349691267650665703796481027128516`15., 13.97349553534538800947199429325424484397`15.}, {{-0.03505766444909271609655203774013107655`15., 0.05622942846843496947960959272666927911`15.}, {0.10187297492719881226769040796006945694`15., 0.01058588200967112669152877749326910128`15.}}} |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| \\|\\|eigvec_k - copy_c\\|\\| (k, c = 1,2; up to sign) | {{0.6952217871538070069`3., 2.48522878007406*^-200}, {2.2802017169644188*^-200, 0.6952217871538070069`3.}} |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| mu | {5, 3, 2} |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| untwisted copies c=1,2 as coefficients on the exact HW kets hwKets[mu] (G-norm 1) | {{-0.01264838336837443191447891824771237207`15., -0.00248101104102891394881994128235303364`15.}, {0.00338912410911517265521965898845311281`15., -0.0345560259960081230882170957546840034`15.}} |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| eigenvalues, eigenvectors (HW-ket coefficients) of the 2x2 matrix of S3c[1,2] at g = 0 | {{39.43506816321428455141427380034910101199`15., 23.79073828839861867439217781255412479445`15.}, {{-0.00338912410911517265521965898845311281`15., 0.0345560259960081230882170957546840034`15.}, {0.01264838336837443191447891824771237207`15., 0.00248101104102891394881994128235303364`15.}}} |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| \\|\\|eigvec_k - copy_c\\|\\| (k, c = 1,2; up to sign) | {{0.4953487361146391079`3., 1.658950210304865*^-200}, {1.5202074835510562*^-200, 0.4953487361146391079`3.}} |  |  |  |  |  |  |",
