   "kind": 1,
   "value": "*Printed output of the code cell above (evaluated from exactly the saved source in kernel K1 via Get; not a native notebook output).*\n\n| | | | | | | | |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| mu | theta | theta12 | M(theta) = matrix of S3c[1,2] (g=0) on HW kets | traceless part prop. to base? | roots r = c2/c1 of M12 r^2 + (M11-M22) r - M21 = 0 | true-copy ratios (sorted) | S3c roots (sorted) |\n| {5, 4, 1} | {2/7, -3/5} | 31/35 | {{455/31, -210/31}, {-35/31, 770/31}} | True | {-1.60391256382996653193508655671008766587`15., 0.10391256382996653193508655671008766589`15.} | {-1.6039125638299665319350865567100876659`15., 0.1039125638299665319350865567100876659`15.} | {-1.60391256382996653193508655671008766587`15., 0.10391256382996653193508655671008766589`15.} |\n| {5, 4, 1} | {1/5, -4/9} | 29/45 | {{585/29, -270/29}, {-45/29, 990/29}} | True | {-1.60391256382996653193508655671008766587`15., 0.10391256382996653193508655671008766589`15.} | {-1.6039125638299665319350865567100876659`15., 0.1039125638299665319350865567100876659`15.} | {-1.60391256382996653193508655671008766587`15., 0.10391256382996653193508655671008766589`15.} |\n| {5, 4, 1} | {3/7, -1/4} | 19/28 | {{364/19, -168/19}, {-28/19, 616/19}} | True | {-1.60391256382996653193508655671008766587`15., 0.10391256382996653193508655671008766589`15.} | {-1.6039125638299665319350865567100876659`15., 0.1039125638299665319350865567100876659`15.} | {-1.60391256382996653193508655671008766587`15., 0.10391256382996653193508655671008766589`15.} |\n| {5, 3, 2} | {2/7, -3/5} | 31/35 | {{2240/93, -140/93}, {-280/93, 3640/93}} | True | {-10.19615242270663188058233902451761710083`15., 0.19615242270663188058233902451761710083`15.} | {-10.19615242270663188058233902451761710083`15., 0.19615242270663188058233902451761710083`15.} | {-10.19615242270663188058233902451761710083`15., 0.19615242270663188058233902451761710083`15.} |\n| {5, 3, 2} | {1/5, -4/9} | 29/45 | {{960/29, -60/29}, {-120/29, 1560/29}} | True | {-10.19615242270663188058233902451761710083`15., 0.19615242270663188058233902451761710083`15.} | {-10.19615242270663188058233902451761710083`15., 0.19615242270663188058233902451761710083`15.} | {-10.19615242270663188058233902451761710083`15., 0.19615242270663188058233902451761710083`15.} |\n| {5, 3, 2} | {3/7, -1/4} | 19/28 | {{1792/57, -112/57}, {-224/57, 2912/57}} | True | {-10.19615242270663188058233902451761710083`15., 0.19615242270663188058233902451761710083`15.} | {-10.19615242270663188058233902451761710083`15., 0.19615242270663188058233902451761710083`15.} | {-10.19615242270663188058233902451761710083`15., 0.19615242270663188058233902451761710083`15.} |\n| traceless part of M(theta) proportional to that at the base theta (universal eigenvectors), every multiplicity-2 sector, 3 theta | True |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| multiplicity-2 sectors in this representation | {{5, 4, 1}, {5, 3, 2}} |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| true copies at g = 0 (eigenvectors of S2 + Pi S3 on the HW space at each theta): ratio c2/c1 equals the roots of the S3c[1,2] quadratic (sorted), max abs difference | 0``13.690533685203988 |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| [3,2,1] in [2,1,0]: M(theta) - (3/(2 theta12)) [[3,-1],[-1,7]] = s 1 (scalar)? {theta, s} | n/a |  |  |  |  |  |  |",
   "languageId": "markdown",
