  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "*Printed output of the code cell above (evaluated from exactly the saved source in kernel K1 via Get; not a native notebook output).*\n\n| | |\n|---|---|\n| check | result |\n| theta12 * M(theta) identical at the 3 theta (exact) => S3c[1,2]\\|_HW = N0/theta12, no scalar part: per sector {mu, constant?, N0, trace, det, eigenvalues, ratio quadratic} | {{{5, 4, 1}, True, {{13, -6}, {-1, 22}}, 35, 280, {22.62347538297979919161051934026052599537`15., 12.37652461702020080838948065973947400463`15.}, 1 - 9*r - 6*r^2}, {{5, 3, 2}, True, {{64/3, -4/3}, {-8/3, 104/3}}, 56, 736, {34.92820323027550917410978536602348946777`15., 21.07179676972449082589021463397651053223`15.}, 8/3 - (40*r)/3 - (4*r^2)/3}} |",
