   "value": "*Printed output of the code cell above (evaluated from exactly the saved source in kernel K1 via Get; not a native notebook output).*\n\n| | | | | | | | | | |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| [3,1,0] sector mu | dual image mu* in [3,2,0] | mult | eigenvalues of theta12 S3c12\\|HW, [3,1,0] | same, [3,2,0] at mu* | difference (sorted) [3,2,0] - [3,1,0] | char. poly [3,1,0] | char. poly [3,2,0] | [3,1,0]: (eigenvalue, G-orthonormal slice ratio) per copy | [3,2,0]: same |\n| {3, 3, 2} | {4, 3, 3} | 1 | {20.`10.} | {36.`10.} | {16.`10.} | 20 - xx | 36 - xx | {} | {} |\n| {4, 2, 2} | {4, 4, 2} | 1 | {18.`10.} | {30.`10.} | {12.`10.} | 18 - xx | 30 - xx | {} | {} |\n| {4, 3, 1} | {5, 3, 2} | 2 | {18.9282032302755091741`10., 5.0717967697244908259`10.} | {34.9282032302755091741`10., 21.0717967697244908259`10.} | {16.`10., 16.`10.} | 96 - 24*xx + xx^2 | 736 - 56*xx + xx^2 | {{18.92820323027550917410978536602348946777`12., -3.60488426005375238465007396129154114219`12.}, {5.07179676972449082589021463397651053223`12., 0.06935035412101476264585215076729594576`12.}} | {{34.92820323027550917410978536602348946777`12., -3.60488426005375238465007396129154114219`12.}, {21.07179676972449082589021463397651053223`12., 0.06935035412101476264585215076729594576`12.}} |\n| {4, 4, 0} | {6, 2, 2} | 1 | {0} | {24.`10.} | {24.`10.} | -xx | 24 - xx | {} | {} |\n| {5, 2, 1} | {5, 4, 1} | 2 | {15.6234753829797991916`10., 5.3765246170202008084`10.} | {22.6234753829797991916`10., 12.3765246170202008084`10.} | {7.`10., 7.`10.} | 84 - 21*xx + xx^2 | 280 - 35*xx + xx^2 | {{15.62347538297979919161051934026052599537`12., -1.97073673244739229852995526441879417834`12.}, {5.37652461702020080838948065973947400463`12., 0.20296977948102348752784435915667158013`12.}} | {{22.62347538297979919161051934026052599537`12., -2.26827490062894116774448855625475453585`12.}, {12.37652461702020080838948065973947400463`12., 0.146954557069298594541955469940207418`12.}} |\n| {5, 3, 0} | {6, 3, 1} | 1 | {0} | {16.`10.} | {16.`10.} | -xx | 16 - xx | {} | {} |\n| {6, 1, 1} | {5, 5, 0} | 1 | {8.`10.} | {0} | {-8.`10.} | 8 - xx | -xx | {} | {} |\n| {6, 2, 0} | {6, 4, 0} | 1 | {0} | {0} | {0} | -xx | -xx | {} | {} |\n| # HW sectors found: [3,2,0] (all sectors with a kernel; = HW sectors of the global-switch run?), [3,1,0] | {8, 8, True} |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| dual map mu -> (6-mu3, 6-mu2, 6-mu1): [3,1,0] HW sectors map exactly onto the [3,2,0] HW sectors, multiplicities preserved | {True, True} |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| consistency with the global-switch data: theta12 M (5,4,1), (5,3,2) of [3,2,0] equal 31/35 * the earlier S3c[1,2] matrices (HW basis may differ): eigenvalues equal? | {True, True} |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |",
