  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## A4(a). Full two-vacua family Φ = ΩD[ζ,ω] ⊗ ΩD[ζ,ω′] (24-point grid): exact undo, closed forms (a′, c′, g′), per-weight ranks, K/S for all 10 branches and three ε, CG at leading order, controls, and the conditioning of every 2x2 extraction system",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
