   "kind": 1,
   "value": "*Printed output of the code cell above (evaluated from exactly the saved source in kernel K1 via Get; not a native notebook output).*\n\n| | | | | | | | |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| family | mu | copy | S: eps-exp range | K: eps-exp range | max \\|K/S\\| at eps = 1e-6, 2e-6, 4e-6 | ratios of max\\|K/S\\| (O(eps): 2, 2) | max undo rel dev |\n| MAIN family (24 points, phi) |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n|  | {6, 4, 0} | 1 | {0., 0.} | K=0 | 0 | - | 0 (acc 199) |\n|  | {6, 3, 1} | 1 | {0., 0.} | {1., 1.} | 2.44e-7, 4.88e-7, 9.76e-7 | 2.000, 2.000 | 0 (acc 199) |\n|  | {6, 2, 2} | 1 | {0., 0.} | {1., 1.} | 9.76e-7, 1.95e-6, 3.91e-6 | 2.000, 2.000 | 0 (acc 198) |\n|  | {5, 5, 0} | 1 | {0., 0.} | {1., 1.} | 2.42e-6, 4.83e-6, 9.67e-6 | 2.000, 2.000 | 0 (acc 198) |\n|  | {5, 4, 1} | 1 | {0., 0.} | {1., 1.} | 2.44e-6, 4.88e-6, 9.75e-6 | 2.000, 2.000 | 0 (acc 196) |\n|  | {5, 4, 1} | 2 | {0., 0.} | {1., 1.} | 1.81e-6, 3.63e-6, 7.26e-6 | 2.000, 2.000 | 0 (acc 197) |\n|  | {5, 3, 2} | 1 | {0., 0.} | {1., 1.} | 1.79e-6, 3.58e-6, 7.17e-6 | 2.000, 2.000 | 0 (acc 194) |\n|  | {5, 3, 2} | 2 | {0., 0.} | {1., 1.} | 1.42e-6, 2.83e-6, 5.67e-6 | 2.000, 2.000 | 0 (acc 195) |\n|  | {4, 4, 2} | 1 | {0., 0.} | {1., 1.} | 5.53e-6, 1.11e-5, 2.21e-5 | 2.000, 2.000 | 0 (acc 194) |\n|  | {4, 3, 3} | 1 | {0., 0.} | {1., 1.} | 4.16e-6, 8.33e-6, 1.67e-5 | 2.000, 2.000 | 0 (acc 194) |\n| CONTROL omega' = (7/4,-2/5) fixed (6 points) |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n|  | {6, 4, 0} | 1 | {0., 0.} | K=0 | 0 | - | 0 (acc 199) |\n|  | {6, 3, 1} | 1 | {0., 0.} | {1., 1.} | 3.45e-6, 6.91e-6, 1.38e-5 | 2.000, 2.000 | 0 (acc 198) |\n|  | {6, 2, 2} | 1 | {0., 0.} | {1., 1.} | 1.38e-5, 2.76e-5, 5.53e-5 | 2.000, 2.000 | 0 (acc 196) |\n|  | {5, 5, 0} | 1 | {0., 0.} | {1., 1.} | 7.49e-7, 1.5e-6, 2.99e-6 | 2.000, 2.000 | 0 (acc 199) |\n|  | {5, 4, 1} | 1 | {0., 0.} | {1., 1.} | 6.33e-7, 1.27e-6, 2.53e-6 | 2.000, 2.000 | 0 (acc 197) |\n|  | {5, 4, 1} | 2 | {0., 0.} | {1., 1.} | 5.32e-7, 1.06e-6, 2.13e-6 | 2.000, 2.000 | 0 (acc 197) |\n|  | {5, 3, 2} | 1 | {0., 0.} | {1., 1.} | 5.05e-6, 1.01e-5, 2.02e-5 | 2.000, 2.000 | 0 (acc 193) |\n|  | {5, 3, 2} | 2 | {0., 0.} | {1., 1.} | 5.35e-6, 1.07e-5, 2.14e-5 | 2.000, 2.000 | 0 (acc 193) |\n|  | {4, 4, 2} | 1 | {0., 0.} | {1., 1.} | 1.45e-6, 2.89e-6, 5.78e-6 | 2.000, 2.000 | 0 (acc 195) |\n|  | {4, 3, 3} | 1 | {0., 0.} | {1., 1.} | 9.88e-6, 1.98e-5, 3.95e-5 | 2.000, 2.000 | 0 (acc 193) |\n| CONTROL common omega1' = omega1 (12 points) |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n|  | {6, 4, 0} | 1 | {0., 0.} | K=0 | 0 | - | 0 (acc 199) |\n|  | {6, 3, 1} | 1 | {0., 0.} | {1., 1.} | 1.34e-7, 2.67e-7, 5.34e-7 | 2.000, 2.000 | 0 (acc 199) |\n|  | {6, 2, 2} | 1 | {0., 0.} | {1., 1.} | 5.34e-7, 1.07e-6, 2.14e-6 | 2.000, 2.000 | 0 (acc 199) |\n|  | {5, 5, 0} | 1 | not read |  |  |  |  |\n|  | {5, 4, 1} | 1 | not read |  |  |  |  |\n|  | {5, 4, 1} | 2 | not read |  |  |  |  |\n|  | {5, 3, 2} | 1 | not read |  |  |  |  |\n|  | {5, 3, 2} | 2 | not read |  |  |  |  |\n|  | {4, 4, 2} | 1 | not read |  |  |  |  |\n|  | {4, 3, 3} | 1 | not read |  |  |  |  |\n| MAIN family with phi' (24 points, eps = 1e-6 only) |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n|  | {6, 4, 0} | 1 | - | K=0 | 0 | - | 0 (acc 199) |\n|  | {6, 3, 1} | 1 | - | - | 4.35e-7 | - | 0 (acc 198) |\n|  | {6, 2, 2} | 1 | - | - | 1.74e-6 | - | 0 (acc 197) |\n|  | {5, 5, 0} | 1 | - | - | 2.29e-6 | - | 0 (acc 198) |\n|  | {5, 4, 1} | 1 | - | - | 2.76e-6 | - | 0 (acc 196) |\n|  | {5, 4, 1} | 2 | - | - | 1.37e-6 | - | 0 (acc 197) |\n|  | {5, 3, 2} | 1 | - | - | 1.96e-6 | - | 0 (acc 194) |\n|  | {5, 3, 2} | 2 | - | - | 1.79e-6 | - | 0 (acc 194) |\n|  | {4, 4, 2} | 1 | - | - | 6.22e-6 | - | 0 (acc 195) |\n|  | {4, 3, 3} | 1 | - | - | 5.e-6 | - | 0 (acc 194) |\n| main family: K/S = O(eps) for every branch | True |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| time (s): one point, main (72 pts), fixed, common1, phi' | {0.0061648, 0.1669154, 0.0537202, 0.0676042, 0.7117292} |  |  |  |  |  |  |",
