   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* A4 (cleaning question), full family: store the full-family data under the names T4F, ksAllF, cgMainF, cgFixF (the (inf,inf) cells below reuse the names T4, ksAll, cgMain), then the CONDITIONING of every 2x2 extraction system of the 2-dim slices (sectors (5,4,1), (5,3,2)). The overlap of a branch with the family point p is R_C(p) = phi_u(p) . c_B + K; for a 2-dim slice two grid points p, p' give the 2x2 system [phi_u(p)[ix]; phi_u(p')[ix]] c = [R_C(p), R_C(p')]. condReport lists, per branch and over ALL pairs of grid points (not only the pairs the CG cell selects): the singular values (sigma1, sigma2) of the 2x2 matrix (phi_u is eps-free in Gaudin, so these do not depend on eps), the extracted slice vector after Richardson (1e-6, 2e-6, 4e-6) against the exact HW-ket slice, and the raw error at eps = 1e-6. Also the ratio C1/C2 of the two slice components of each copy (basis-independent mixing diagnostic) exact vs extracted. *)\nck = <||>;\nfsN[x_List, n_] := \"{\" <> StringRiffle[fsN[#, n] & /@ x, \", \"] <> \"}\";\nfsN[x_, n_] := With[{v = N[x]}, If[v == 0, \"0\", With[{e = Floor[Log10[Abs[v]]]}, ToString[Round[v/10^e, 10.^-(n - 1)]] <> \"e\" <> ToString[e]]]];\nT4F = T4; ksAllF = ksAll; cgMainF = cgMain; cgFixF = cgFix; famMainF = famMain; famFixedF = famFixed;\ncondReport[key_, fam_, ph_] := Module[{pts = fam[\"pts\"], np, phis, ibs, hdr, rows, epsFree, usedAll = {}},\n  np = Length[pts]; phis = Table[phiAt[fam, ph, ie, pt], {ie, 3}, {pt, pts}];\n  epsFree = Max[Abs[phis[[1]] - phis[[3]]]];\n  ibs = Select[Range[nb], Length[idxOf[hwListG[[#, 1]] - Λ]] == 2 &];\n  rows = Table[Module[{multTwo, usedPairs, mu = hwListG[[ib, 1]], ix, exact, RC, allp, data, usedData, srt, best, worst, ratio, rExact, rExtr, rChain, cgRes = If[key === \"main\", cgMain, cgFix]},\n     ix = idxOf[mu - Λ]; exact = cgRes[[ib]][\"exact\"];\n     usedPairs = Select[Table[{k, k + Floor[np/2]}, {k, Floor[np/2]}], Abs[Det[phis[[1, #, ix]]]] > 10^-3 Max[Abs[phis[[1, #, ix]]]]^2 &]; If[usedPairs === {}, usedPairs = {{1, 2}}];\n     RC = Table[T4[key][[ie, ip, ib, \"RC\"]], {ie, 3}, {ip, np}];\n     allp = Subsets[Range[np], {2}];\n     data = Table[Module[{sv = SingularValueList[phis[[1, pp, ix]]], cs, ri},\n        If[Length[sv] < 2 || sv[[2]] < 10^-30 sv[[1]], Nothing,\n         cs = Table[LinearSolve[phis[[ie, pp, ix]], RC[[ie, pp]]], {ie, 3}]; ri = rich3[cs];\n         {pp, sv[[1]], sv[[2]], Norm[ri - exact]/Norm[exact], Norm[cs[[1]] - exact]/Norm[exact]}]], {pp, allp}];\n     usedData = Select[data, MemberQ[usedPairs, #[[1]]] &];\n     srt = SortBy[data, -#[[3]] &]; best = First[srt]; worst = Last[srt];\n     multTwo = Length[hwKets[mu]] == 2; If[multTwo, rExact = exact[[1]]/exact[[2]]; rExtr = cgRes[[ib]][\"rich\"][[1]]/cgRes[[ib]][\"rich\"][[2]]; rChain = cgRes[[ib]][\"richChain\"][[1]]/cgRes[[ib]][\"richChain\"][[2]]];\n     {ToString[mu], hwListG[[ib, 2]], ToString[Length[data]] <> \"/\" <> ToString[Length[allp]],\n      If[usedData === {}, \"-\", fsN[{Min[usedData[[All, 2]]], Max[usedData[[All, 2]]]}, 4] <> \" | \" <> fsN[{Min[usedData[[All, 3]]], Max[usedData[[All, 3]]]}, 4]],\n      If[usedData === {}, \"-\", fsN[Max[usedData[[All, 4]]], 3]],\n      ToString[best[[1]]] <> \": \" <> fsN[{best[[2]], best[[3]]}, 4] <> \", err \" <> fsN[best[[4]], 3],\n      ToString[worst[[1]]] <> \": \" <> fsN[{worst[[2]], worst[[3]]}, 4] <> \", err \" <> fsN[worst[[4]], 3],\n      fsN[Median[data[[All, 5]]], 3] <> \" (median raw err at 1e-6)\",\n      If[multTwo, fsN[{rExact, rExtr, rChain}, 12] <> \", rel dev \" <> fsN[Abs[rExtr/rExact - 1], 3], \"multiplicity 1: n/a\"]}], {ib, ibs}];\n  <|\"epsFree\" -> epsFree, \"np\" -> np, \"rows\" -> rows|>];\ncondHdr = {\"mu\", \"copy\", \"# usable pairs / total\", \"used pairs: sigma1 range | sigma2 range\", \"used pairs: max Richardson err\", \"best sigma2 pair: (sigma1, sigma2), Richardson err\", \"worst usable sigma2 pair\", \"raw err\", \"slice ratio C1/C2: exact, extracted (used pair 1), chain; rel dev\"};\ncdMain = condReport[\"main\", famMain, phiP];\ncdFix = condReport[\"fixed\", famFixed, phiP];\nck[\"full family main: max |phi_u(eps=1e-6) - phi_u(eps=4e-6)| (exact eps-independence => 0 up to the 200-digit rounding), number of grid points\"] = {sz[cdMain[\"epsFree\"]], cdMain[\"np\"]};\nchecks = Join[checks, ck];\nGrid[Join[{{\"FULL family, MAIN: conditioning of the 2x2 extraction systems\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\"}, condHdr}, cdMain[\"rows\"], {{\"FULL family, CONTROL omega' = (7/4,-2/5) fixed (the 2x2 systems)\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\"}, condHdr}, cdFix[\"rows\"], List @@@ Normal[ck] /. {a_, b_} :> {a, b, \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\"}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
