airs / total | used pairs: sigma1 range \\| sigma2 range | used pairs: max Richardson err | best sigma2 pair: (sigma1, sigma2), Richardson err | worst usable sigma2 pair | raw err | slice ratio C1/C2: exact, extracted (used pair 1), chain; rel dev |\n| {5, 4, 1} | 1 | 15/15 | {1.735e0, 2.361e0} \\| {1.451e-1, 3.058e-1} | 1.32e-17 | {1, 3}: {2.057e0, 1.63e0}, err 9.69e-19 | {1, 5}: {1.739e0, 6.541e-3}, err 3.59e-13 | 3.89e-7 (median raw err at 1e-6) | {2.07825e-1, 2.07825e-1, 2.07825e-1}, rel dev 1.64e-17 |\n| {5, 4, 1} | 2 | 15/15 | {1.735e0, 2.361e0} \\| {1.451e-1, 3.058e-1} | 1.e-17 | {1, 3}: {2.057e0, 1.63e0}, err 1.75e-18 | {1, 5}: {1.739e0, 6.541e-3}, err 3.38e-13 | 3.22e-7 (median raw err at 1e-6) | {-3.20783e0, -3.20783e0, -3.20783e0}, rel dev 9.56e-18 |\n| {5, 3, 2} | 1 | 15/15 | {9.187e-1, 4.007e0} \\| {2.604e-3, 1.052e-1} | 3.53e-14 | {1, 2}: {4.007e0, 9.17e-1}, err 1.91e-18 | {1, 5}: {9.184e-1, 4.796e-4}, err 1.72e-12 | 1.99e-6 (median raw err at 1e-6) | {9.80762e-2, 9.80762e-2, 9.80762e-2}, rel dev 4.4e-17 |\n| {5, 3, 2} | 2 | 15/15 | {9.187e-1, 4.007e0} \\| {2.604e-3, 1.052e-1} | 2.55e-14 | {1, 2}: {4.007e0, 9.17e-1}, err 4.24e-18 | {1, 5}: {9.184e-1, 4.796e-4}, err 3.02e-12 | 2.18e-6 (median raw err at 1e-6) | {-5.09808e0, -5.09808e0, -5.09808e0}, rel dev 1.3e-17 |\n| {4, 4, 2} | 1 | 15/15 | {1.464e0, 2.604e0} \\| {1.027e-2, 5.161e-2} | 4.32e-17 | {1, 2}: {2.884e0, 1.372e0}, err 1.5e-18 | {1, 5}: {1.849e0, 8.712e-4}, err 7.18e-13 | 4.07e-7 (median raw err at 1e-6) | multiplicity 1: n/a |\n| full family main: max \\|phi_u(eps=1e-6) - phi_u(eps=4e-6)\\| (exact eps-independence => 0 up to the 200-digit rounding), number of grid points | {2.1462188678221036*^-199, 24} |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |",
