   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* Task A3. Phi^inf = OmegaDinf[zeta, om1] (x) OmegaDinf[zeta, om1']. (a) exact undo <Phi|h> = <e1 rho(n(om1) n(om1')^-1) (x) e1|h> on all HW kets at P, P', and regime points (om1 = eps oh1, om1' = eps oh1'). (b) closed forms of the undone Gauss parameters (a', c', g' = b' - a' c') in (phi, oh1, oh1') (Factor); eps-free asserted symbolically; Jacobian rank of (oh1, oh1') -> (a', c', g'); controls om1' = om1. (c) per-weight ranks of phi_u = e1 rho(n') over the grid (4 points; enlarge if short), on every weight of V and on the slice weights nu = mu - Lambda actually used by the HW kets. *)\nck = <||>;\ninfW[w1_] := {w1, Infinity};\nundoPtsInf = {{zP, infW[5/2], infW[7/4]}, {zQ, infW[-2/5], infW[3]}, {{-1, 7/3, 1/2}, infW[9/7], infW[-5/3]}};\nundoPtsInf = Join[undoPtsInf, Flatten[Table[{ee phiP, infW[ee a], infW[ee b]}, {ee, {10^-6, 4 10^-6}}, {a, {3/4, -5/3}}, {b, {-12/5, 7/2}}], 2]];\nundoTestInf[p_] := Module[{zz = p[[1]], w = p[[2]], wp = p[[3]], lhs, rhs, wrong},\n  lhs = kron[ΩD[zz, w], ΩD[zz, wp]]; rhs = kron[phiUof[zz, w, wp], e1]; wrong = kron[ΩD[zz, w], e1];\n  {And @@ (lhs . # === rhs . # & /@ u12HW), Or @@ (lhs . # =!= wrong . # & /@ u12HW)}];\n{tUndoI, undoResI} = AbsoluteTiming[undoTestInf /@ undoPtsInf];\nck[\"(a) exact undo on all HW kets at 11 points (P, P', 1 generic, 8 regime): {all equal, naive e1 (x) e1-type control differs}\"] = {Length[undoPtsInf], undoResI};\n(* (b) closed forms *)\nnpInf = Map[Together, nPrime[symZ, {o1, Infinity}, {p1, Infinity}], {2}];\nparInf = Map[Factor, {npInf[[1, 2]], npInf[[2, 3]], Together[npInf[[1, 3]] - npInf[[1, 2]] npInf[[2, 3]]]}];\n{aI, cI, gI} = parInf;\nck[\"(b) closed forms: a', c', g' = b' - a' c' (symbolic in zeta = (f1,f2,f3), om1 = o1, om1' = p1)\"] = {ToString[aI, InputForm], ToString[cI, InputForm], ToString[gI, InputForm]};\nck[\"(b) eps-free: parameters at (f, o1, p1) -> eps (f, o1, p1) equal the parameters at eps = 1 (symbolic, exact)\"] = Simplify[(parInf /. {f1 -> ep f1, f2 -> ep f2, f3 -> ep f3, o1 -> ep o1, p1 -> ep p1}) - parInf] === {0, 0, 0};\nck[\"(b) the XXX factorisation structure: a' = (f2 - f1)(o1 - p1)/((f2 - o1)(f2 - p1))? compare with the round-1 finite-twist a' at om2 = om2' = infinity (symbolic equality)\"] = Simplify[aI - (-(((-f1 + f2) (o1 - p1))/((f2 - o1) (f2 - p1))))] === 0;\njacI = D[parInf, {{o1, p1}}];\nrankPtsI = {{f1 -> 1/3, f2 -> -2/7, f3 -> 5/11, o1 -> 3/4, p1 -> -12/5}, {f1 -> 1/3, f2 -> -2/7, f3 -> 5/11, o1 -> -5/3, p1 -> 7/2}, {f1 -> -2/5, f2 -> 3/8, f3 -> 7/11, o1 -> 5/7, p1 -> 2/9}, {f1 -> 3/2, f2 -> 5/4, f3 -> 2/3, o1 -> 5/2, p1 -> 7/4}};\nck[\"(b) rank of the Jacobian of (oh1, oh1') -> (a', c', g') at 4 generic points (expect 2)\"] = Table[MatrixRank[jacI /. pt], {pt, rankPtsI}];\nck[\"(b) the three functions (a', c', g') are algebraically dependent? (Jacobian 3x2 so yes); relation test: rank of the 3x3 matrix [grad a', grad c', grad g'] w.r.t. (o1, p1, f1) at a generic point (expect 3 if f1 enters independently)\"] = MatrixRank[D[parInf, {{o1, p1, f1}}] /. rankPtsI[[3]]];\nck[\"controls: om1' = om1 gives n' = 1 exactly (a' = c' = g' = 0)\"] = Together[parInf /. p1 -> o1] === {0, 0, 0};\n(* (c) per-weight ranks *)\ngridI = Flatten[Table[{a, b}, {a, {3/4, -5/3}}, {b, {-12/5, 7/2}}], 1];\ngridIx = Join[gridI, {{1/2, -1/3}, {-7/3, 5/4}}];\nphiGridI[ph_, pts_] := Table[phiUof[ph, infW[pt[[1]]], infW[pt[[2]]]], {pt, pts}];\nslicesNeeded = Union[hwSecs - Table[Λ, {Length[hwSecs]}]];\nwtRanksI = Table[{u12wts[[m]], u12dims[[m]], MatrixRank[phiGridI[phiP, gridI][[All, u12idx[[m]]]]], MatrixRank[phiGridI[phiP, gridIx][[All, u12idx[[m]]]]], MatrixRank[phiGridI[phiC, gridI][[All, u12idx[[m]]]]], MemberQ[slicesNeeded, u12wts[[m]]]}, {m, Length[u12wts]}];\nck[\"(c) per-weight ranks over the 4-point grid at phi, over 6 points at phi, over 4 points at phi' : {weight, dim, rank4, rank6, rank4(phi'), used as a CG slice weight}\"] = wtRanksI;\nck[\"(c) CG-complete on the slice weights used (rank = dim with the 4-point grid)\"] = And @@ (#[[3]] == #[[2]] & /@ Select[wtRanksI, #[[6]] &]);\nck[\"(c) CG-complete on EVERY weight of V (rank = dim with the 4-point grid; with the 6-point grid)\"] = {And @@ (#[[3]] == #[[2]] & /@ wtRanksI), And @@ (#[[4]] == #[[2]] & /@ wtRanksI)};\nck[\"(c) regression: phi_u(grid, 4 points) = coverG[{a', g', c'}] from the closed forms (exact)\"] = And @@ Table[phiUof[phiP, infW[pt[[1]]], infW[pt[[2]]]] === coverG[{aI, gI, cI} /. Thread[{f1, f2, f3, o1, p1} -> Join[phiP, pt]]], {pt, gridIx}];\nchecks = Join[checks, ck];\nGrid[Join[{{\"time (s)\", N[tUndoI, 3]}}, List @@@ Normal[ck]], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
