   "value": "*Printed output of the code cell above (evaluated from exactly the saved source in kernel K1 via Get; not a native notebook output).*\n\n| | | | | | | | |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| family | mu | copy | S: eps-exp range | K: eps-exp range | max \\|K/S\\| at eps = 1e-6, 2e-6, 4e-6 | ratios of max\\|K/S\\| (O(eps): 2, 2) | max undo rel dev |\n| (inf,inf) MAIN family (6 points, phi) |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n|  | {6, 4, 0} | 1 | {0., 0.} | K=0 | 0 | - | 0 (acc 199) |\n|  | {6, 3, 1} | 1 | {0., 0.} | {1., 1.} | 1.27e-6, 2.54e-6, 5.09e-6 | 2.000, 2.000 | 0 (acc 198) |\n|  | {6, 2, 2} | 1 | {0., 0.} | {1., 1.} | 5.09e-6, 1.02e-5, 2.04e-5 | 2.000, 2.000 | 0 (acc 197) |\n|  | {5, 5, 0} | 1 | {0., 0.} | {1., 1.} | 2.42e-6, 4.83e-6, 9.67e-6 | 2.000, 2.000 | 0 (acc 198) |\n|  | {5, 4, 1} | 1 | {0., 0.} | {1., 1.} | 5.75e-7, 1.15e-6, 2.3e-6 | 2.000, 2.000 | 0 (acc 196) |\n|  | {5, 4, 1} | 2 | {0., 0.} | {1., 1.} | 2.53e-6, 5.07e-6, 1.01e-5 | 2.000, 2.000 | 0 (acc 196) |\n|  | {5, 3, 2} | 1 | {0., 0.} | {1., 1.} | 2.39e-6, 4.78e-6, 9.56e-6 | 2.000, 2.000 | 0 (acc 193) |\n|  | {5, 3, 2} | 2 | {0., 0.} | {1., 1.} | 1.3e-6, 2.61e-6, 5.21e-6 | 2.000, 2.000 | 0 (acc 193) |\n|  | {4, 4, 2} | 1 | {0., 0.} | {1., 1.} | 1.37e-6, 2.75e-6, 5.49e-6 | 2.000, 2.000 | 0 (acc 193) |\n|  | {4, 3, 3} | 1 | {0., 0.} | {1., 1.} | 3.65e-6, 7.31e-6, 1.46e-5 | 2.000, 2.000 | 0 (acc 192) |\n| CONTROL omega1' = 7/4 fixed, omega2 = omega2' = infinity (4 points) |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n|  | {6, 4, 0} | 1 | {0., 0.} | K=0 | 0 | - | 0 (acc 199) |\n|  | {6, 3, 1} | 1 | {0., 0.} | {1., 1.} | 5.35e-7, 1.07e-6, 2.14e-6 | 2.000, 2.000 | 0 (acc 198) |\n|  | {6, 2, 2} | 1 | {0., 0.} | {1., 1.} | 2.14e-6, 4.28e-6, 8.57e-6 | 2.000, 2.000 | 0 (acc 198) |\n|  | {5, 5, 0} | 1 | {0., 0.} | {1., 1.} | 1.04e-6, 2.09e-6, 4.18e-6 | 2.000, 2.000 | 0 (acc 198) |\n|  | {5, 4, 1} | 1 | {0., 0.} | {1., 1.} | 6.57e-7, 1.31e-6, 2.63e-6 | 2.000, 2.000 | 0 (acc 197) |\n|  | {5, 4, 1} | 2 | {0., 0.} | {1., 1.} | 3.33e-6, 6.66e-6, 1.33e-5 | 2.000, 2.000 | 0 (acc 196) |\n|  | {5, 3, 2} | 1 | {0., 0.} | {1., 1.} | 1.37e-6, 2.74e-6, 5.49e-6 | 2.000, 2.000 | 0 (acc 194) |\n|  | {5, 3, 2} | 2 | {0., 0.} | {1., 1.} | 8.39e-6, 1.68e-5, 3.36e-5 | 2.000, 2.000 | 0 (acc 193) |\n|  | {4, 4, 2} | 1 | {1., 1.} | {1., 1.} | 4.65e-1, 4.65e-1, 4.65e-1 | 1.000, 1.000 | 0 (acc 188) |\n|  | {4, 3, 3} | 1 | {1., 1.} | {1., 1.} | 3.88e-1, 3.88e-1, 3.88e-1 | 1.000, 1.000 | 0 (acc 187) |\n| CONTROL omega1' = omega1 (3 points; Phi = Omega (x) Omega) |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n|  | {6, 4, 0} | 1 | {0., 0.} | K=0 | 0 | - | 0 (acc 199) |\n|  | {6, 3, 1} | 1 | not read |  |  |  |  |\n|  | {6, 2, 2} | 1 | not read |  |  |  |  |\n|  | {5, 5, 0} | 1 | not read |  |  |  |  |\n|  | {5, 4, 1} | 1 | not read |  |  |  |  |\n|  | {5, 4, 1} | 2 | not read |  |  |  |  |\n|  | {5, 3, 2} | 1 | not read |  |  |  |  |\n|  | {5, 3, 2} | 2 | not read |  |  |  |  |\n|  | {4, 4, 2} | 1 | not read |  |  |  |  |\n|  | {4, 3, 3} | 1 | not read |  |  |  |  |\n| MAIN family with phi' (6 points, eps = 1e-6 only) |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n|  | {6, 4, 0} | 1 | - | K=0 | 0 | - | 0 (acc 199) |\n|  | {6, 3, 1} | 1 | - | - | 1.9e-6 | - | 0 (acc 197) |\n|  | {6, 2, 2} | 1 | - | - | 7.6e-6 | - | 0 (acc 196) |\n|  | {5, 5, 0} | 1 | - | - | 2.29e-6 | - | 0 (acc 198) |\n|  | {5, 4, 1} | 1 | - | - | 5.95e-7 | - | 0 (acc 197) |\n|  | {5, 4, 1} | 2 | - | - | 2.08e-6 | - | 0 (acc 196) |\n|  | {5, 3, 2} | 1 | - | - | 3.46e-6 | - | 0 (acc 193) |\n|  | {5, 3, 2} | 2 | - | - | 2.23e-6 | - | 0 (acc 193) |\n|  | {4, 4, 2} | 1 | - | - | 1.37e-6 | - | 0 (acc 194) |\n|  | {4, 3, 3} | 1 | - | - | 5.54e-6 | - | 0 (acc 193) |\n| main family: K/S = O(eps) for every branch | True |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| time (s): one point, main (72 pts), fixed, common1, phi' | {0.0020401, 0.0350656, 0.0273323, 0.0163383, 0.0118006} |  |  |  |  |  |  |",
