   "value": "*Printed output of the code cell above (evaluated from exactly the saved source in kernel K1 via Get; not a native notebook output).*\n\n| | | | | | | | | | |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| mu | copy | slice dim | spread over grid (eps=1e-6, 4e-6) | \\|overlap C/chain slice - 1\\| at 1e-6, 2e-6, 4e-6 | err ratio 4e-6/1e-6 (O(eps): 4) | exact HW-ket slice (G-norm 1) | overlap-extracted, Richardson limit | max rel \\|extracted - exact\\| | max rel \\|chain Richardson - exact\\| |\n| MAIN family |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| {6, 4, 0} | 1 | 1 | 0 (acc 199), 0 (acc 199) | 0 (acc 199), 0 (acc 199), 0 (acc 199) | - | {1.`10.} | {1.`10.} | 0 (acc 199) | 0 (acc 199) |\n| {6, 3, 1} | 1 | 1 | 1.05e-6, 4.2e-6 | 1.27e-6, 2.54e-6, 5.09e-6 | 4.00 | {-0.5`10.} | {-0.50000000000000000000507276670521251502`10.} | 1.01e-20 | 3.47e-27 |\n| {6, 2, 2} | 1 | 1 | 4.2e-6, 1.68e-5 | 5.09e-6, 1.02e-5, 2.04e-5 | 4.00 | {0.28867513459481288225457439025097872783`10.} | {0.28867513459481288236565043719707203006`10.} | 3.85e-19 | 3.39e-25 |\n| {5, 5, 0} | 1 | 1 | 2.e-6, 8.e-6 | 2.42e-6, 4.83e-6, 9.67e-6 | 4.00 | {-0.70710678118654752440084436210484903928`10.} | {-0.70710678118654752444244517428350265558`10.} | 5.88e-20 | 2.72e-26 |\n| {5, 4, 1} | 1 | 2 | 5.35e-6, 2.14e-5 | 8.15e-6, 1.63e-5, 3.26e-5 | 4.00 | {0.04234352803868450676611510997307640512`10., 0.20374594985439762453538081592013891388`10.} | {0.04234352803868450688103231725870074337`10., 0.20374594985439762442460416823627856305`10.} | 5.64e-19 | 1.97e-21 |\n| {5, 4, 1} | 2 | 2 | 4.73e-6, 1.89e-5 | 7.21e-6, 1.44e-5, 2.88e-5 | 4.00 | {0.22491771387373987791843837090667711644`10., -0.0701153288981854321931040754802621531`10.} | {0.22491771387373987798375082277714906207`10., -0.07011532889818543225207116025020203208`10.} | 2.9e-19 | 1.84e-21 |\n| {5, 3, 2} | 1 | 2 | 9.76e-6, 3.9e-5 | 1.55e-5, 3.1e-5, 6.19e-5 | 4.00 | {-0.00744303312308674184645982384705910092`10., -0.07589030021024659148687350948627423242`10.} | {-0.00744303312308674199311617937122249861`10., -0.07589030021024659139855137036082642622`10.} | 1.93e-18 | 1.56e-20 |\n| {5, 3, 2} | 2 | 2 | 5.7e-6, 2.28e-5 | 8.13e-6, 1.63e-5, 3.25e-5 | 4.00 | {-0.10366807798802436926465128726405201019`10., 0.02033474465469103593131795393071867686`10.} | {-0.10366807798802436912120807062284561167`10., 0.02033474465469103583591824634231975116`10.} | 1.38e-18 | 1.54e-20 |\n| {4, 4, 2} | 1 | 2 | 1.16e-5, 4.65e-5 | 2.29e-5, 4.57e-5, 9.15e-5 | 4.00 | {0, -0.07453559924999298988030578895770920785`10.} | {5.3852124499334138022`10.*^-19, -0.07453559924999299080976025977938810709`10.} | 1.25e-17 | 3.23e-27 |\n| {4, 3, 3} | 1 | 1 | 2.74e-6, 1.09e-5 | 3.65e-6, 7.31e-6, 1.46e-5 | 4.00 | {-0.02282177322938192139404040761670008891`10.} | {-0.02282177322938192140014136751684115609`10.} | 2.67e-19 | 4.81e-25 |\n| CONTROL omega' fixed |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| {6, 4, 0} | 1 | 1 | 0 (acc 199), 0 (acc 199) | 0 (acc 199), 0 (acc 199), 0 (acc 199) | - | {1.`10.} | {1.`10.} | 0 (acc 199) | 0 (acc 199) |\n| {6, 3, 1} | 1 | 1 | 3.64e-7, 1.46e-6 | 5.35e-7, 1.07e-6, 2.14e-6 | 4.00 | {-0.5`10.} | {-0.49999999999999999993956374908901975082`10.} | 1.21e-19 | 3.47e-27 |\n| {6, 2, 2} | 1 | 1 | 1.46e-6, 5.83e-6 | 2.14e-6, 4.28e-6, 8.57e-6 | 4.00 | {0.28867513459481288225457439025097872783`10.} | {0.28867513459481288230162960393593507153`10.} | 1.63e-19 | 3.39e-25 |\n| {5, 5, 0} | 1 | 1 | 7.29e-7, 2.92e-6 | 1.04e-6, 2.09e-6, 4.18e-6 | 4.00 | {-0.70710678118654752440084436210484903928`10.} | {-0.70710678118654752418735745507187594887`10.} | 3.02e-19 | 2.72e-26 |\n| {5, 4, 1} | 1 | 2 | 0 (acc 197), 0 (acc 197) | 5.93e-1, 5.93e-1, 5.93e-1 | 1.00 | {0.04234352803868450676611510997307640512`10., 0.20374594985439762453538081592013891388`10.} | {0.15281150802915325255896970477492917455`10., 0.14851195985916325154538150217430116243`10.} | 5.42e-1 | 1.97e-21 |\n| {5, 4, 1} | 2 | 2 | 0 (acc 196), 0 (acc 196) | 5.24e-1, 5.24e-1, 5.24e-1 | 1.00 | {0.22491771387373987791843837090667711644`10., -0.0701153288981854321931040754802621531`10.} | {0.33538569386420862370186513883511709262`10., -0.12534931889341980517105649636496543296`10.} | 4.91e-1 | 1.84e-21 |\n| {5, 3, 2} | 1 | 2 | 0 (acc 194), 0 (acc 194) | 1.46e0, 1.46e0, 1.46e0 | 1.00 | {-0.00744303312308674184645982384705910092`10., -0.07589030021024659148687350948627423242`10.} | {-0.11537937766339896182912145337360055114`10., -0.04890621407516853654367411777197463687`10.} | 1.42e0 | 1.56e-20 |\n| {5, 3, 2} | 2 | 2 | 0 (acc 193), 0 (acc 193) | 4.87e-1, 4.87e-1, 4.87e-1 | 1.00 | {-0.10366807798802436926465128726405201019`10., 0.02033474465469103593131795393071867686`10.} | {-0.15360210381808251979930779964001773186`10., 0.03281825111220557374131296525488919684`10.} | 4.82e-1 | 1.54e-20 |\n| {4, 4, 2} | 1 | 2 | 0 (acc 189), 0 (acc 189) | 5.67e-1, 5.67e-1, 5.67e-1 | 1.00 | {0, -0.07453559924999298988030578895770920785`10.} | {-0.04167644229174608032657127777284238042`10., -0.06751821060949364981324073820786031502`10.} | 5.59e-1 | 3.23e-27 |\n| {4, 3, 3} | 1 | 1 | 1.58e-6, 6.32e-6 | 3.88e-1, 3.88e-1, 3.88e-1 | 1.00 | {-0.02282177322938192139404040761670008891`10.} | {-0.03166521035576741594554099616984415985`10.} | 3.88e-1 | 4.81e-25 |\n| control omega1' = 7/4 fixed: eps -> 0 limit of phi_u finite and per-weight ranks over 4 directions {weight, dim, rank} | {True, {{{0, 2, 3}, 1, 0}, {{0, 3, 2}, 1, 0}, {{1, 1, 3}, 1, 0}, {{1, 2, 2}, 2, 0}, {{1, 3, 1}, 1, 0}, {{2, 0, 3}, 1, 1}, {{2, 1, 2}, 2, 1}, {{2, 2, 1}, 2, 1}, {{2, 3, 0}, 1, 1}, {{3, 0, 2}, 1, 1}, {{3, 1, 1}, 1, 1}, {{3, 2, 0}, 1, 1}}} |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| u = e1 E13 and u' = e1 E23 E12 are supported on the weight Lambda+(-1,0,1) slice: supports vs idxOf[{1,1,1}] | {{5, 7}, {5}, {5, 7}} |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| mixing R_c = (u.C_c)/(u'.C_c): {mu, copy} | exact copy | overlap Richardson | chain Richardson | rel dev overlap | rel dev chain |  |  |  |  |\n| {{5, 4, 1}, 1} | 4.31173769149 | 4.31173769149 | 4.31173769149 | -3.64e-18 | 1.18e-20 |  |  |  |  |\n| {{5, 4, 1}, 2} | -0.811737691490 | -0.811737691490 | -0.811737691490 | 2.11e-19 | -2.23e-21 |  |  |  |  |\n| time (s) main CG | 0.0381177 |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |",
