   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* A4 (cleaning question), (inf,inf) family: the same conditioning report of the 2x2 extraction systems as for the full family (condReport is defined in the full-family conditioning cell), now for the (inf,inf) MAIN family (6 grid points) and the CONTROL omega1' = 7/4 fixed (4 points); and a side-by-side K/S summary of both families (max over branches of max|K/S| at eps = 1e-6 and its doubling ratios) for the cleaning verdict. *)\nck = <||>;\ncdIMain = condReport[\"main\", famMain, phiP];\ncdIFix = condReport[\"fixed\", famFixed, phiP];\nck[\"(inf,inf) main: max |phi_u(eps=1e-6) - phi_u(eps=4e-6)|, number of grid points\"] = {sz[cdIMain[\"epsFree\"]], cdIMain[\"np\"]};\nmaxKS[ks_] := Table[{r[[1]], r[[2]], r[[5]], r[[6]]}, {r, ks}];\nchecks = Join[checks, ck];\nGrid[Join[{{\"(inf,inf) family, MAIN: conditioning of the 2x2 extraction systems\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\"}, condHdr}, cdIMain[\"rows\"], {{\"(inf,inf) family, CONTROL omega1' = 7/4 fixed (2x2 systems)\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\"}, condHdr}, cdIFix[\"rows\"], List @@@ Normal[ck] /. {a_, b_} :> {a, b, \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\"}, {{\"K/S summary (mu, copy, max|K/S| at 1e-6, 2e-6, 4e-6, ratios): FULL family MAIN\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\"}}, maxKS[ksAllF[\"main\"]], {{\"K/S summary: (inf,inf) family MAIN\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\"}}, maxKS[ksAll[\"main\"]]], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
