   "kind": 1,
   "value": "*Printed output of the code cell above (evaluated from exactly the saved source in kernel K1 via Get; not a native notebook output).*\n\n| | | | | | | | | |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| (inf,inf) family, MAIN: conditioning of the 2x2 extraction systems |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| mu | copy | # usable pairs / total | used pairs: sigma1 range \\| sigma2 range | used pairs: max Richardson err | best sigma2 pair: (sigma1, sigma2), Richardson err | worst usable sigma2 pair | raw err | slice ratio C1/C2: exact, extracted (used pair 1), chain; rel dev |\n| {5, 4, 1} | 1 | 15/15 | {5.916e-1, 1.81e2} \\| {1.827e-2, 1.043e0} | 7.67e-19 | {1, 5}: {1.81e2, 1.217e0}, err 1.24e-20 | {2, 3}: {1.086e0, 1.165e-2}, err 4.53e-19 | 5.63e-7 (median raw err at 1e-6) | {2.07825e-1, 2.07825e-1, 2.07825e-1}, rel dev 3.26e-18 |\n| {5, 4, 1} | 2 | 15/15 | {5.916e-1, 1.81e2} \\| {1.827e-2, 1.043e0} | 3.73e-19 | {1, 5}: {1.81e2, 1.217e0}, err 1.98e-20 | {2, 3}: {1.086e0, 1.165e-2}, err 1.45e-19 | 4.76e-7 (median raw err at 1e-6) | {-3.20783e0, -3.20783e0, -3.20783e0}, rel dev 5.51e-19 |\n| {5, 3, 2} | 1 | 15/15 | {2.124e-1, 9.081e2} \\| {1.029e-3, 9.321e-1} | 4.05e-18 | {1, 5}: {9.081e2, 1.329e0}, err 2.55e-20 | {2, 3}: {9.393e-1, 3.143e-4}, err 1.3e-17 | 2.27e-6 (median raw err at 1e-6) | {9.80762e-2, 9.80762e-2, 9.80762e-2}, rel dev 2.09e-17 |\n| {5, 3, 2} | 2 | 15/15 | {2.124e-1, 9.081e2} \\| {1.029e-3, 9.321e-1} | 5.06e-18 | {1, 5}: {9.081e2, 1.329e0}, err 5.82e-20 | {2, 3}: {9.393e-1, 3.143e-4}, err 1.64e-17 | 6.76e-7 (median raw err at 1e-6) | {-5.09808e0, -5.09808e0, -5.09808e0}, rel dev 3.31e-18 |\n| {4, 4, 2} | 1 | 15/15 | {1.691e-1, 8.217e-1} \\| {3.049e-4, 7.383e-4} | 1.44e-17 | {1, 5}: {2.402e4, 3.824e-1}, err 6.96e-20 | {2, 3}: {1.781e-1, 1.587e-4}, err 1.16e-17 | 1.05e-6 (median raw err at 1e-6) | multiplicity 1: n/a |\n| (inf,inf) family, CONTROL omega1' = 7/4 fixed (2x2 systems) |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| mu | copy | # usable pairs / total | used pairs: sigma1 range \\| sigma2 range | used pairs: max Richardson err | best sigma2 pair: (sigma1, sigma2), Richardson err | worst usable sigma2 pair | raw err | slice ratio C1/C2: exact, extracted (used pair 1), chain; rel dev |\n| {5, 4, 1} | 1 | 6/6 | {1.318e0, 1.318e0} \\| {1.505e-7, 1.505e-7} | 5.93e-1 | {1, 2}: {1.318e0, 1.505e-7}, err 5.93e-1 | {2, 4}: {1.54e-1, 1.906e-8}, err 5.93e-1 | 5.93e-1 (median raw err at 1e-6) | {2.07825e-1, 1.02895e0, 2.07825e-1}, rel dev 3.95e0 |\n| {5, 4, 1} | 2 | 6/6 | {1.318e0, 1.318e0} \\| {1.505e-7, 1.505e-7} | 5.24e-1 | {1, 2}: {1.318e0, 1.505e-7}, err 5.24e-1 | {2, 4}: {1.54e-1, 1.906e-8}, err 5.24e-1 | 5.24e-1 (median raw err at 1e-6) | {-3.20783e0, -2.67561e0, -3.20783e0}, rel dev 1.66e-1 |\n| {5, 3, 2} | 1 | 6/6 | {1.186e0, 1.186e0} \\| {1.682e-8, 1.682e-8} | 1.46e0 | {1, 3}: {6.608e1, 1.196e-7}, err 1.46e0 | {2, 4}: {1.853e-2, 1.688e-9}, err 1.46e0 | 1.46e0 (median raw err at 1e-6) | {9.80762e-2, 2.3592e0, 9.80762e-2}, rel dev 2.31e1 |\n| {5, 3, 2} | 2 | 6/6 | {1.186e0, 1.186e0} \\| {1.682e-8, 1.682e-8} | 4.87e-1 | {1, 3}: {6.608e1, 1.196e-7}, err 4.87e-1 | {2, 4}: {1.853e-2, 1.688e-9}, err 4.87e-1 | 4.87e-1 (median raw err at 1e-6) | {-5.09808e0, -4.68039e0, -5.09808e0}, rel dev 8.19e-2 |\n| {4, 4, 2} | 1 | 6/6 | {5.758e-7, 5.758e-7} \\| {8.675e-15, 8.675e-15} | 5.67e-1 | {1, 3}: {3.207e-5, 6.167e-14}, err 5.67e-1 | {2, 4}: {8.993e-9, 8.705e-16}, err 5.67e-1 | 5.67e-1 (median raw err at 1e-6) | multiplicity 1: n/a |\n| (inf,inf) main: max \\|phi_u(eps=1e-6) - phi_u(eps=4e-6)\\|, number of grid points | {6.36167832167832*^-195, 6} |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| K/S summary (mu, copy, max\\|K/S\\| at 1e-6, 2e-6, 4e-6, ratios): FULL family MAIN |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| {6, 4, 0} | 1 | 0 | - |  |  |  |  |  |\n| {6, 3, 1} | 1 | 2.44e-7, 4.88e-7, 9.76e-7 | 2.000, 2.000 |  |  |  |  |  |\n| {6, 2, 2} | 1 | 9.76e-7, 1.95e-6, 3.91e-6 | 2.000, 2.000 |  |  |  |  |  |\n| {5, 5, 0} | 1 | 2.42e-6, 4.83e-6, 9.67e-6 | 2.000, 2.000 |  |  |  |  |  |\n| {5, 4, 1} | 1 | 2.44e-6, 4.88e-6, 9.75e-6 | 2.000, 2.000 |  |  |  |  |  |\n| {5, 4, 1} | 2 | 1.81e-6, 3.63e-6, 7.26e-6 | 2.000, 2.000 |  |  |  |  |  |\n| {5, 3, 2} | 1 | 1.79e-6, 3.58e-6, 7.17e-6 | 2.000, 2.000 |  |  |  |  |  |\n| {5, 3, 2} | 2 | 1.42e-6, 2.83e-6, 5.67e-6 | 2.000, 2.000 |  |  |  |  |  |\n| {4, 4, 2} | 1 | 5.53e-6, 1.11e-5, 2.21e-5 | 2.000, 2.000 |  |  |  |  |  |\n| {4, 3, 3} | 1 | 4.16e-6, 8.33e-6, 1.67e-5 | 2.000, 2.000 |  |  |  |  |  |\n| K/S summary: (inf,inf) family MAIN |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| {6, 4, 0} | 1 | 0 | - |  |  |  |  |  |\n| {6, 3, 1} | 1 | 1.27e-6, 2.54e-6, 5.09e-6 | 2.000, 2.000 |  |  |  |  |  |\n| {6, 2, 2} | 1 | 5.09e-6, 1.02e-5, 2.04e-5 | 2.000, 2.000 |  |  |  |  |  |\n| {5, 5, 0} | 1 | 2.42e-6, 4.83e-6, 9.67e-6 | 2.000, 2.000 |  |  |  |  |  |\n| {5, 4, 1} | 1 | 5.75e-7, 1.15e-6, 2.3e-6 | 2.000, 2.000 |  |  |  |  |  |\n| {5, 4, 1} | 2 | 2.53e-6, 5.07e-6, 1.01e-5 | 2.000, 2.000 |  |  |  |  |  |\n| {5, 3, 2} | 1 | 2.39e-6, 4.78e-6, 9.56e-6 | 2.000, 2.000 |  |  |  |  |  |\n| {5, 3, 2} | 2 | 1.3e-6, 2.61e-6, 5.21e-6 | 2.000, 2.000 |  |  |  |  |  |\n| {4, 4, 2} | 1 | 1.37e-6, 2.75e-6, 5.49e-6 | 2.000, 2.000 |  |  |  |  |  |\n| {4, 3, 3} | 1 | 3.65e-6, 7.31e-6, 1.46e-5 | 2.000, 2.000 |  |  |  |  |  |",
