  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "*Printed output of the code cell above (evaluated from exactly the saved source in kernel K1 via Get; not a native notebook output).*\n\n| | | | | | | | |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| Lambda | dim | \\|Lambda\\| | localises | t (T = t Omega (x) Omega) | Sum lambda^2 | k = \\|Lambda\\|^2 - t | c_H = \\|Lambda\\| Sum zeta + k/theta12 |\n| {1, 0, 0} | 3 | 1 | True | 1 | 1 | 0 | \\|Lambda\\| (z1+z2+z3) + 0/theta12 |\n| {1, 1, 0} | 3 | 2 | True | 2 | 2 | 2 | \\|Lambda\\| (z1+z2+z3) + 2/theta12 |\n| {2, 0, 0} | 6 | 2 | True | 4 | 4 | 0 | \\|Lambda\\| (z1+z2+z3) + 0/theta12 |\n| {2, 1, 0} | 8 | 3 | True | 5 | 5 | 4 | \\|Lambda\\| (z1+z2+z3) + 4/theta12 |\n| {2, 2, 0} | 6 | 4 | True | 8 | 8 | 8 | \\|Lambda\\| (z1+z2+z3) + 8/theta12 |\n| {3, 1, 0} | 15 | 4 | True | 10 | 10 | 6 | \\|Lambda\\| (z1+z2+z3) + 6/theta12 |\n| {3, 2, 0} | 15 | 5 | True | 13 | 13 | 12 | \\|Lambda\\| (z1+z2+z3) + 12/theta12 |\n| {4, 1, 0} | 24 | 5 | True | 17 | 17 | 8 | \\|Lambda\\| (z1+z2+z3) + 8/theta12 |\n| {3, 2, 1} | 8 | 6 | True | 14 | 14 | 22 | \\|Lambda\\| (z1+z2+z3) + 22/theta12 |\n| {2, 1, 1} | 3 | 4 | True | 6 | 6 | 10 | \\|Lambda\\| (z1+z2+z3) + 10/theta12 |\n| T = t Omega (x) Omega exactly (localisation) for every representation at 3 points; t independent of (zeta, omega) (one value) | True |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| t = Sum lambda_i^2 (Casimir of the top component 2 Lambda minus twice that of Lambda, halved) for every representation | True |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| fit of the 1/theta12 coefficient k(l1, l2) on 6 reps (lambda3 = 0), as a polynomial in (l1, l2) = (x1, x2) | 2*x1*x2 |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| check of the fit on the two largest reps {3,2,0}, {4,1,0}: fit - exact | {0, 0} |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| conjecture k = 2 l1 on all reps with lambda3 = 0: holds? (reps where it fails) | {{1, 0, 0}, {2, 0, 0}, {2, 2, 0}, {3, 2, 0}} |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| closed form k = \\|Lambda\\|^2 - Sum lambda_i^2 = 2 (l1 l2 + l1 l3 + l2 l3) on all 10 reps (including lambda3 != 0) | True |  |  |  |  |  |  |",
   "languageId": "markdown",
