   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* Task A5. Reference tables. For a point zeta and a list of states: x0G.Psi (x0G = x0Of[zeta], the (PauxG^-1)^T Gauss-factorised vacuum covector), the equal-twist overlap <OmegaD[zeta, om0] (x) OmegaD[zeta, om0]|Psi>, and for each pair (om1, om1') the overlap <Phi^inf|Psi> with Phi^inf = OmegaDinf[zeta, om1] (x) OmegaDinf[zeta, om1'] and Qnum = <Phi^inf|Psi>/<x0G|Psi>, together with the eigenvalue pair (S2(u0), S3(u1)) identifying the state. All from the 200-digit G-normalised eigenvectors, printed at 30 digits. *)\nck = <||>;\nfmtS[x_] := Module[{v = Re[N[x, 45]]}, If[Abs[v] < 10^-150, \"0\", With[{e = Floor[Log10[Abs[v]]]}, ToString[NumberForm[v/10^e, {32, 30}]] <> \"e\" <> ToString[e]]]];\na5Rows[zz_, sts_, pairs_, om0_] := Module[{x0 = N[x0Of[zz], pr], eq0 = kron[N[ΩD[zz, om0[[1 ;; 2]]], pr], N[ΩD[zz, om0[[1 ;; 2]]], pr]], phis = Table[kron[N[ΩDinf[zz, p[[1]]], pr], N[ΩDinf[zz, p[[2]]], pr]], {p, pairs}]},\n  Table[Module[{s = sts[[i]], psi, xo, eo, po}, psi = s[\"psi\"];\n    xo = x0 . psi; eo = eq0 . psi; po = (# . psi) & /@ phis;\n    Join[{i, ToString[s[\"mu\"]], s[\"k\"], fmtS[s[\"ev2\"]], fmtS[s[\"ev3\"]], fmtS[xo], fmtS[eo]}, Flatten[Table[{fmtS[po[[j]]], fmtS[po[[j]]/xo]}, {j, Length[pairs]}]]]], {i, Length[sts]}]];\na5Head[pairs_] := Join[{\"#\", \"mu\", \"k\", \"S2(u0)\", \"S3(u1)\", \"<x0G|Psi>\", \"<OmD(w0) (x) OmD(w0)|Psi>\"}, Flatten[Table[{\"<Phi^inf\" <> ToString[p, InputForm] <> \"|Psi>\", \"Qnum\" <> ToString[p, InputForm]}, {p, pairs}]]];\nw0ref = {5/2, 7/3, 3/5};\npairsFin = {{5/2, 7/4}, {-2/5, 3}};\ntabP = a5Rows[zP, stP, pairsFin, w0ref];\ntabQ = a5Rows[zQ, BQ[\"states\"], pairsFin, w0ref];\n(* regime point: HW branches at eps = 1e-6 (zeta = eps phi, om1 = eps oh1), pairs (oh1, oh1') = (3/4, -12/5), (-5/3, 7/2) *)\nee0 = epsL[[1]]; zR = ee0 phiP;\nstR = Table[brOf[B1, hwListG[[ib, 1]], hwListG[[ib, 2]]], {ib, nb}];\ntabR = a5Rows[zR, stR, ee0 {{3/4, -12/5}, {-5/3, 7/2}}, ee0 {2/5, 1/7, 1/3}];\nck[\"P: d2 = 225 rows, all <x0G|Psi> nonzero, # finite Qnum\"] = {Length[tabP], Count[tabP[[All, 6]], \"0\"], Count[tabP[[All, 9]], s_ /; s =!= \"0\"]};\nck[\"P': d2 = 225 rows\"] = Length[tabQ];\nck[\"regime eps = 1e-6: HW branches (10 rows)\"] = Length[tabR];\nGrid[Join[{{\"A5-1: P = zeta (3/2,5/4,2/3), theta (2/7,-3/5), w0 = (5/2,7/3,3/5); pairs (om1,om1') = (5/2,7/4), (-2/5,3); Phi^inf = OmegaDinf (x) OmegaDinf\"}, a5Head[pairsFin], {}}, tabP,\n  {{\"A5-2: P' = zeta (2,5/3,-1/2), same theta, w0, pairs\"}, a5Head[pairsFin]}, tabQ,\n  {{\"A5-3: regime eps = 1e-6, zeta = eps (1/3,-2/7,5/11), w0 = eps (2/5,1/7,1/3), pairs eps(3/4,-12/5), eps(-5/3,7/2); HW branches (sorted by mu, copy as in hwListG)\"}, a5Head[ee0 {{3/4, -12/5}, {-5/3, 7/2}}]}, tabR, List @@@ Normal[ck]], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
